om/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commit/ce557737135c07675725af4da76161bc60beaf2c","node_id":"C_kwDORUvwUtoAKGNlNTU3NzM3MTM1YzA3Njc1NzI1YWY0ZGE3NjE2MWJjNjBiZWFmMmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commit/33b65502067e9898359ca16126a310a9a020b4a5","sha":"33b65502067e9898359ca16126a310a9a020b4a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/33b65502067e9898359ca16126a310a9a020b4a5"}],"sha":"ce557737135c07675725af4da76161bc60beaf2c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/ce557737135c07675725af4da76161bc60beaf2c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/33b65502067e9898359ca16126a310a9a020b4a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T12:36:10Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T12:36:10Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"fix(datahub): remove deprecated URN pre-flight + fix parcel weather values shape\n\nBug 1 (worker): resolveEntityId() called the deprecated\n/api/entities/<urn>/timeseries-location endpoint, which returns 204 for\nAgriParcel entities without weather_location_id. The worker cached this as\nnull and short-circuited to empty series, never reaching the BFF.\n\nFix: remove the pre-flight entirely. The timeseries-reader V2 resolves URNs\nnatively (Strangler Fig) — the BFF passes URNs directly now.\n\nBug 2 (BFF): _fetch_from_parcel_weather_api returned values as a dict\nkeyed by attribute name (e.g. {\"temp_avg\": [20,21]}) for single-attr\nqueries. The frontend parser checked Array.isArray(payload.values) which\nfailed for dicts, producing empty charts.\n\nFix: single attr → flat array (values: [...]); multi attr → value_0/value_1\nconvention matching _reader_json_to_frontend_json.\n\nAlso:\n- Removed dead code: resolveEntityId(), urnResolutionCache,\n  TimeseriesLocationResponse (~50 lines) from datahubWorker.ts\n- Extracted pure parsing helpers to src/workers/parsing.ts (testable)\n- Added 18 unit tests (vitest) covering all 3 JSON shapes + edge cases\n- Added BFF values-shape contract tests (pytest, backend/tests/)\n- TypeScript compiles clean (tsc --noEmit ✓)","tree":{"sha":"4981ad0a218032df6ca254df3b349d5c3b703482","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/4981ad0a218032df6ca254df3b349d5c3b703482"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/33b65502067e9898359ca16126a310a9a020b4a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://ap