ments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/62c0a9a7bae351abf9c7ae74ef9bb89a8e6ebe16/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-01T10:14:18Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T19:16:08Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"fix(datahub): accept all NGSI-LD properties as timeseries attributes\n\nPreviously _norm_entity() required numeric values on Orion-LD entity properties\nand checked against a strict whitelist (_TELEMETRY_VALID_ATTRS, _WEATHER_VALID_COLUMNS).\nThis caused count=0 because timeseries data lives in TimescaleDB, not as Orion-LD\nproperty values.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove numeric value requirement — accept any Property type (not just numeric)\n- Simplify _canonical_timescale_attr() to pass through all non-empty attribute names\n  (keeping only the well-known NGSI-LD → timescale column mapping)\n- Timeseries-reader validates data availability at query time; entity tree now shows\n  all available attributes","tree":{"sha":"8184d15a845e06d60b56e33a2c5bf1c750122dfc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/8184d15a845e06d60b56e33a2c5bf1c750122dfc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/62c0a9a7bae351abf9c7ae74ef9bb89a8e6ebe16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","rec