:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/41416cc1a4bbde7294caf87a8f28e3700bd90976/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:56:42Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:56:42Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"docs(datahub): update deployment artifacts for Module Federation 2.0\n\nReplace IIFE references (nkz-module.js, style.css) with MF2 artifacts\n(mf-manifest.json, remoteEntry.js, assets/). Add ConfigMap template with\nall env vars documented. Rename CI job from build-iife to build-frontend.","tree":{"sha":"66661bd72e73c585f5ba0cfaa183c3054f364648","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/66661bd72e73c585f5ba0cfaa183c3054f364648"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/41416cc1a4bbde7294caf87a8f28e3700bd90976","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commit/41416cc1a4bbde7294caf87a8f28e3700bd90976","node_id":"C_kwDORUvwUtoAKDQxNDE2Y2MxYTRiYmRlNzI5NGNhZjg3YThmMjhlMzcwMGJkOTA5NzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commit/ec903ad2abddb98dd0991b865284ce22bc623386","sha":"ec903ad2abddb98dd0991b865284ce22bc623386","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/ec903ad2abddb98dd0991b865284ce22bc623386"}],"sha":"41416cc1a4bbde7294caf87a8f28e3700bd90976","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/41416cc1a4bbde7294caf87a8f28e3700bd90976"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/ec903ad2abddb98dd0991b865284ce22bc623386/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:02:13Z","email":"125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"k8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-21T19:02:13Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(mf2): share @tanstack/react-query singleton with host (#13)\n\nDataTree.tsx throws \"No QueryClient set\" in production because the\ndeployed datahub bundle did not declare @tanstack/react-query as a\nfederation singleton. As a result, the QueryClientProvider mounted by\nthe host''s NKZProvider and the useQuery call inside the module read\ntwo different QueryClientContext instances.\n\nRoot cause: @nekazari/module-builder@2.0.3..2.0.5 published to npm do\nnot list @tanstack/react-query in NKZ_SHARED (the source in nkz/ has\nthe fix but no version >2.0.5 has been published yet).\n\nWorkaround: bump module-builder to ^2.0.5 (no functional change vs\n^2.0.3 for this issue, but other recent fixes ride along), and pass\nadditionalShared in vite.config.ts so react-query joins the federation\nshare scope alongside the platform defaults.\n\nThe override can be removed once an @nekazari/module-builder release\nships the upstream change.\n\nVerified locally: dist/mf-manifest.json now lists @tanstack/react-query\nunder shared, and a dedicated loadShare chunk for react-query is\nemitted (previously it was concatenated into the @nekazari/module-kit\nloadShare chunk, which is what caused the dual-instance bug).","tree":{"sha":"561c411f0deedc2d37f0884de0587fc4ee432c94","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/561c411f0deedc2d37f0884de0587fc4ee432c94"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/ec903ad2abddb98dd0991b865284ce22bc623386","verification":{"payload":"tree 561c411f0deedc2d37f0884de0587fc4ee432c94\nparent ceaef273cfc2d441029d334518c9295452ecb5f7\nauthor k8 <125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com> 1779390133 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779390133 +0200\n\nfix(mf2): share @tanstack/react-query singleton with host (#13)\n\nDataTree.tsx throws \"No QueryClient set\" in production because the\ndeployed datahub bundle did not declare @tanstack/react-query as a\nfederation singleton. As a result, the QueryClientProvider mounted by\nthe host''s NKZProvider and the useQuery call inside the module read\ntwo different QueryClientContext instances.\n\nRoot cause: @nekazari/module-builder@2.0.3..2.0.5 published to npm do\nnot list @tanstack/react-query in NKZ_SHARED (the source in nkz/ has\nthe fix but no version >2.0.5 has been published yet).\n\nWorkaround: bump module-builder to ^2.0.5 (no functional change vs\n^2.0.3 for this issue, but other recent fixes ride along), and pass\nadditionalShared in vite.config.ts so react-query joins the federation\nshare scope alongside the platform defaults.\n\nThe override can be removed once an @nekazari/module-builder release\nships the upstream change.\n\nVerified locally: dist/mf-manifest.json now lists @tanstack/react-query\nunder shared, and a dedicated loadShare chunk for react-query is\nemitted (previously it was concatenated into the @nekazari/module-kit\nloadShare chunk, which is what caused the dual-instance bug).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqD1a1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAqFEQAFuKyj7fUcpdp