ource of truth for module\nidentity, routing, slots, permissions, i18n.\n\n- Add src/Module.tsx with full ModuleDefinition (route, navigation,\n  requiredRoles, requiredPlan, api, slots) carried over from\n  manifest.json\n- Delete src/moduleEntry.ts (entry is now auto-generated by\n  module-builder into node_modules/.nkz/moduleEntry.gen.ts)\n- Delete manifest.json (the host reads metadata from defineModule\n  via module-builder; manifest.json emission for dist/ comes in\n  Fase A.2 via the nkz CLI)\n- Simplify vite.config.ts: nkzModulePreset() reads moduleId from\n  package.json#nkz.moduleId\n- Bump @nekazari/module-builder to ^1.1.1 and @nekazari/module-kit\n  to ^0.2.0\n\nVerified locally: pnpm typecheck clean, pnpm build:module produces\ndist/nkz-module.js (309 kB, same shape as before).","tree":{"sha":"a9433f13e2b12d9deec77a34abc2abf5c57c5082","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/a9433f13e2b12d9deec77a34abc2abf5c57c5082"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/66edb1e1d9c0471cd708342e82777ee38f36fa91","verification":{"payload":"tree a9433f13e2b12d9deec77a34abc2abf5c57c5082\nparent 0962c6d8064589521e5b3e7651eeaf9921cab768\nauthor k8 <125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com> 1778651531 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778651531 +0200\n\nfeat: migrate to defineModule v2 (module-kit 0.2.0) (#5)\n\nReplace hand-written src/moduleEntry.ts with src/Module.tsx exporting\ndefineModule({...}) — the new single source of truth for module\nidentity, routing, slots, permissions, i18n.\n\n- Add src/Module.tsx with full ModuleDefinition (route, navigation,\n  requiredRoles, requiredPlan, api, slots) carried over from\n  manifest.json\n- Delete src/moduleEntry.ts (entry is now auto-generated by\n  module-builder into node_modules/.nkz/moduleEntry.gen.ts)\n- Delete manifest.json (the host reads metadata from defineModule\n  via module-builder; manifest.json emission for dist/ comes in\n  F