etis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/0ebaa875487e526d588b2942359101a3785e477e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-07T11:40:24Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-07T12:24:33Z","email":"gilleniko@gmail.com","name":"g"},"message":"refactor(ui): remove translucent internals from datahub tactical canvas\n\nNormalize DataHub overlays, headers, and interaction chrome to opaque surfaces, and keep design-system dependencies explicit for consistent rendering across environments.","tree":{"sha":"7973534599c5b93806b4a67209f7410d7c163a7b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/7973534599c5b93806b4a67209f7410d7c163a7b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/0ebaa875487e526d588b2942359101a3785e477e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commit/0ebaa875487e526d588b2942359101a3785e477e","node_id":"C_kwDORUvwUtoAKDBlYmFhODc1NDg3ZTUyNmQ1ODhiMjk0MjM1OTEwMWEzNzg1ZTQ3N2U","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commit/403900c2091aa9f75b2e6d146c1e8eaf2c757e3c","sha":"403900c2091aa9f75b2e6d146c1e8eaf2c757e3c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/403900c2091aa9f75b2e6d146c1e8eaf2c757e3c"}],"sha":"0ebaa875487e526d588b2942359101a3785e477e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/0ebaa875487e526d588b2942359101a3785e477e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125390342?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/k8-benetis","id":125390342,"login":"k8-benetis","node_id":"U_kgDOB3lOBg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/k8-benetis","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/commits/403900c2091aa9f75b2e6d146c1e8eaf2c757e3c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-03T06:27:35Z","email":"125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com","name":"k8"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-03T06:27:35Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(weather): auto-route parcel weather queries to corrected API (#4)\n\nArchitecture overhaul of the weather subsystem:\n\n- Promote weather from ADDON_FREE to CORE (migration 071) — it is\n  platform infrastructure, not an optional addon: 6 risk models, agro\n  panel, crop-health, vegetation-prime, and agrienergy all depend on it.\n\n- New spatial downscaler module (spatial_downscaler.py): corrects\n  municipality-level weather for individual parcels using:\n  1. Environmental lapse rate (altitude, 6.5 C/km)\n  2. FAO solar radiation model (aspect + slope)\n  3. Inverse Distance Weighting (multi-station interpolation)\n  4. Magnus psychrometric Delta-T recalculation\n\n- New canonical endpoint GET /api/weather/parcel/{id}: resolves parcel\n  location from Orion-LD, finds nearest weather data, applies spatial\n  downscaling, returns corrected observations. Single source of truth\n  for all weather consumers.\n\n- Auto-discovery of weather locations from Orion-LD AgriParcel entities\n  via PostGIS nearest-neighbor (replaces hardcoded Pamplona/Madrid\n  fallback).\n\n- Open-Meteo station elevation captured and propagated through the\n  pipeline (provider → metadata → storage → Orion sync → downscaler).\n\n- Alert system: AEMET alerts now displayed as colour-coded banners in\n  WeatherWidget (yellow/orange/red). Webhook-based dispatch\n  (WEATHER_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL) for N8N/Zulip integration instead of\n  hardcoded email. In-app banners as primary notification channel.\n\n- Frontend: parcel selector on weather page synchronises municipality\n  across Widget and AgroPanel. GDD and ET0 cards added. Downscaling\n  indicator badge shown when parcel-level corrections are active.\n  WeatherStationsList component shows registered stations with live\n  readings. Broken Delta-T approximation removed (now uses server-\n  computed Magnus formula). Direct Open-Meteo browser fallbacks removed\n  (all data flows through platform API).\n\n- Risk worker: _get_weather_for_entity() method added for per-entity\n  weather via the parcel API, with DB-direct fallback.\n\n- Bugfix: both weather observation endpoints were missing delta_t in\n  their SELECT queries — frontend expected it but API never returned it.","tree":{"sha":"94eee29f4691feb308502acd912245e42888d387","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/trees/94eee29f4691feb308502acd912245e42888d387"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nkz-os/nkz-module-data-hub/git/commits/403900c2091aa9f75b2e6d146c1e8eaf2c757e3c","verification":{"payload":"tree 94eee29f4691feb308502acd912245e42888d387\nparent a4ccd80f27fe8e35070e4afe35d5f93565ef6cc1\nauthor k8 <125390342+k8-benetis@users.noreply.github.com> 1777789655 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1777789655 +0200\n\nfeat(weather): auto-route parcel weather queries to corrected API (#4)\n\nArchitecture overhaul of the weather subsystem:\n\n- Promote weather from ADDON_FREE to CORE (migration 071) — it is\n  platform infrastructure, not an optional addon: 6 risk models, agro\n  panel, crop-health, vegetation-prime, and agrienergy all depend on it.\n\n- New spatial downscaler module (spatial_downscaler.py): corrects\n  municipality-level weather for individual parcels using:\n  1. Environmental lapse rate (altitude, 6.5 C/km)\n  2. FAO solar radiation model (aspect + slope)\n  3. Inverse Distance Weighting (multi-station interpolation)\n  4. Magnus psychrometric Delta-T recalculation\n\n- New canonical endpoint GET /api/weather/parcel/{id}: resolves parcel\n  location from Orion-LD, finds nearest weather data, applies spatial\n  downscaling, returns corrected observations. Single source of truth\n  for all weather consumers.\n\n- Auto-discovery of weather locations from Orion-LD AgriParcel entities\n  via PostGIS nearest-neighbor (replaces hardcoded Pamplona/Madrid\n  fallback).\n\n- Open-Meteo station elevation captured and propagated through the\n  pipeline (provider → metadata → storage → Orion sync → downscaler).\n\n- Alert system: AEMET alerts now displayed as colour-coded banners in\n  WeatherWidget (yellow/orange/red). Webhook-based dispatch\n  (WEATHER_ALERT_WEBHOOK_URL) for N8N/Zulip integration instead of\n  hardcoded email. In-app banners as primary notification channel.\n\n- Frontend: parcel selector on weather page synchronises municipality\n  across Widget and AgroPanel. GDD and ET0 cards added. Downscaling\n  indicator badge shown when parcel-level corrections are active.\n  WeatherStationsList component shows registered stations with live\n  readings. Broken Delta-T approximation removed (now uses server-\n  computed Magnus formula). Direct Open-Meteo browser fallbacks removed\n  (all data flows through platform API).\n\n- Risk worker: _get_weather_for_entity() method added for per-entity\n  weather via the parcel API, with DB-direct fallback.\n\n- Bugfix: both weather observation endpoints were missing delta_t in\n  their SELECT queries — frontend expected it but API never returned it.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp9urXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAL4QAHJM83Koi0filsQOXeDgxuY1\njgDyPxg7ZbDpECYnp+P8Nhf/Dys2X1lsWG/Bxbwbw445V6KTRof9Xrd10E0UKSLy\n/ouRa8n0jf/NyvCvUvE288bT8YJl6SQLPv49SXFawV2HaAHnabBSeoKbkCrNOlLz\nyqTqPzFt6zeZRPQK1A6CjsIsObpr07BJ89/lYueSAdWeh6CWmZFYgYjl/ckLTNEc\nrMY7nWNVJQpNVt9ge5tGvgZqpaQGd2+Ue0/Hwcfr/Tpp9q/9J7fcjtzJNTUtSnsT\n47Tzz0/ZLp+qZqZa4ZirY9HCsvmkaNfQBdgiXlKUVIxZtRLVqFWB01CSYffSJxRN\nIuuFcJj+D9wy2mCCUeAAdnzXmQVzDwtzHeiX8mnKTvgttqGc1cSywIYh7jCaYTS1\ntruqWBpJkP2l6qLkerBny1q0Y9co69FeZaPNB/4UBuzboQ/dOZa/Be9KfDFH4EVT\nv5PrPr2ZRxKrYiOPoHXPNtnNQG7Y/zFj9YFAmHUC5D95FwclQvLhA+TmjpI2s3Vw\nHThGpew1gVhA8uNI6986uosTeS/sI686v1ODdeuYIrRRhXzqlFIlXuJOe1EgXHwy\nl9M/61MpcIkuqG+WOeur0mMu2AYyFTFZBiMv0KFTa3wVDch1Yx34Pk38sBa4V7aH\nKuMrX7eSVH8wRHwzljET\n=CpnS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-03T06:27:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447