users/pixerael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoltra/yoltra/commits/5233b937cc3c7d5ab7601e7c83ea033ba5be96d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T05:52:39Z","email":"manu@erael.com.mx","name":"pixerael"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T05:52:39Z","email":"manu@erael.com.mx","name":"pixerael"},"message":"Merge branch ''feat/ds-0.4.0'' into release/next\n\nBrings the design system''s 0.4.0 work alongside core''s 0.9.0 so one release\ncovers both. `rush version --bump` moves the lock-step suite and `@yoltra/ds`\ntogether, and the two bodies of work touch no file in common, so the merge is\nclean by construction rather than by resolution.\n\nThe design system versions independently, so this is `@yoltra/ds` 0.3.0 to 0.4.0\nand the suite 0.8.0 to 0.9.0 in the same commit on main.\n\nSigned-off-by: pixerael <manu@erael.com.mx>","tree":{"sha":"87d8ed18c3817debfb36a99aeb413f3d83882dd4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoltra/yoltra/git/trees/87d8ed18c3817debfb36a99aeb413f3d83882dd4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yoltra/yoltra/git/commits/5233b937cc3c7d5ab7601e7c83ea033ba5be96d9","verification":{"payload":"tree 87d8ed18c3817debfb36a99aeb413f3d83882dd4\nparent ed0a4162e47031dae5201e39956469632af0a3d7\nparent 8f54042797ac1533ec6ab5771aede96cff3ab89b\nauthor pixerael <manu@erael.com.mx> 1790661159 -0600\ncommitter pixerael <manu@erael.com.mx> 1790661159 -0600\n\nMerge branch ''feat/ds-0.4.0'' into release/next\n\nBrings the design system''s 0.4.0 work alongside core''s 0.9.0 so one release\ncovers both. `rush version --bump` moves the lock-step suite and `@yoltra/ds`\ntogether, and the two bodies of work touch no file in common, so the merge is\nclean by construction