ump: the lock-step yoltra suite (core, react, devtools-*) moves from 0.7.0 to 0.8.0 and the CHANGELOGs are written. ds stays at 0.3.0 since its only change file is type none.\n\nThis commit is published through a manual run of the Release workflow, not a tag. The examples resolve @yoltra/* from npm, so they cannot move to 0.8.0 until it is published. The v0.8.0 tag goes on the follow-up commit that bumps them.\n\nSigned-off-by: pixerael <manu@erael.com.mx>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQIzBAABCgAdFiEEiYJ/db9FG152opo3pw5WayLacv0FAmq4zsEACgkQpw5WayLa\ncv3OBg//SbIcQmOkZpFBQ455WR4PdUAIiV69n6ParDluUktFTBU999goiigZxrqG\nIxXPRAff+A9JboLlgaWv3pxl22qUEEi9Z8A3HMOpO0ho9Xu9nq6W5OZNr9bkpP+j\nCuw4gGoghxWX3SJP5G8MqIVG4JaDO6gvtG9ArcPxaqRordMwovMKbS3carcy0aLr\nWKXLzjdgSB09piPxE2wi5OGB9Iyz//udMH27pQ6tQJeWh3vE+g4GfM5/n438MeEx\nwvAFZ6LhiNlA7g6tj8GLhuMrq2PaijMJsMpviq8GqHuPnAD/dmiqXgqxglDDlqGk\nYaleMSDZPmGqM8h90JGir5Uvu6S8yBVVINAqw9sAGrEP42j7jOhF3qtP9tHAIMTe\nE06nfsvo5KTq5fxFLzdoan9UlVmm2F643oAMIe3OVAvDYpSL7hsQ7THxrJ9NT2/Q\ntxlJRmUCMemWUc65uO6A4xpvkB1iap/9914eTJ6byF9sYZxyjzWA9aeKruF0xw8+\nvZV2ksoMDYU4m/NwYXFUvwOVZJwmyVbKfM4eaR3szY5gG98DMmET/p6RSrynHbnF\n3hLy4njdtrhMINMwxykfM/RJz7WYzvs8/ejWxpCrRAuVdEU6+UVsH9vF9INrzA0x\nYxB/m9eaj1QpeVq4fvM89BM+LFr64urV8dWW0zXBfDYrfhOBkPQ=\n=q35y\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T08:07:34Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/228319905?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/pixerael","id":228319905,"login":"pixerael","node_id":"U_kgDODZvioQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pixerael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pix