4ntom","node_id":"U_kgDOB6dC5Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blu3Ph4ntom/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blu3Ph4ntom/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blu3Ph4ntom/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blu3Ph4ntom/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blu3Ph4ntom/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Blu3Ph4ntom","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blu3Ph4ntom/port0/commits/d5da71cb753addef4a649a9f180b3ef606ed9707/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T16:05:53Z","email":"hemanth00405@gmail.com","name":"Hemanth M"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T16:46:04Z","email":"hemanth00405@gmail.com","name":"Hemanth M"},"message":"Initial release: port0 - No ports. Just names.\n\nFeatures:\n- Auto-assign free ports via PORT env injection\n- Reverse proxy on port 80 with human-readable hostnames\n- Support for .localhost, .web, .local domains\n- Subdomain support for monorepos (api.myapp.localhost)\n- Dot notation for quick subdomain setup (-n api.myapp)\n- Embedded DNS server for *.web domains\n- Process supervision with auto-restart options\n- HTTPS/TLS support with self-signed certs\n- Cross-platform: macOS, Linux, Windows\n\nUsage:\n  port0 npm run dev              # project.localhost\n  port0 -n api.myapp npm run dev # api.myapp.localhost\n  port0 -n api --domain myapp    # explicit subdomain","tree":{"sha":"94df617d8ffe84148dc279dd150fd22825ac7ad4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blu3Ph4ntom/port0/git/trees/94df617d8ffe84148dc279dd150fd22825ac7ad4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Blu3Ph4ntom/port0/git/commits/d5da71cb753addef4a649a9f180b3ef606ed9707","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128402149?v=4","e