committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T00:12:23Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): implement analytics agent for crop predictions and market insights\n\n- Added a new `analytics.py` agent to provide crop predictions and actionable market insights through a multi-node workflow.\n- Implemented `predictive_modeling_node` to calculate regressions using `PricingAnalyticsService` with PostgreSQL queries for trend analysis.\n- Added `fetch_market_context_node` to retrieve environmental (weather) and event-based (local food festivals) context impacting market conditions.\n- Developed `insight_generation_node` to combine data-driven predictions with local context using LLM-powered insights.\n- Built the analytics workflow with `StateGraph`, enabling stateful execution and parallel node processing:\n  - Defined nodes for predictions, context retrieval, and insights.\n  - Configured entry and exit points, and seamless state transitions.\n- Enhanced logging and error handling to ensure robustness and traceability.\n\nThis implementation establishes a comprehensive framework for providing farmers with predictive and actionable analytics, integrating both statistical and localized contextual data.","tree":{"sha":"240867fc8fbb684dada7445e79c17703d622f894","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/240867fc8fbb684dada7445e79c17703d622f894"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/2307658c3184f4f292b8268e4e3b470af861f6b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist