","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:20Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:20Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): refactor discovery agent for competitor analysis and SEO support\n\n- Refactored `discovery.py` to focus on competitor analysis, replacing `FarmLead` logic with `CompetitorFarm`.\n- Updated workflow nodes:\n  - `search_usda_node` now identifies local competitors instead of raw leads.\n  - `enrich_leads_node`, `audit_leads_node`, and `save_leads_node` replaced with `enrich_competitors_node`, `audit_competitors_node`, and `market_gap_node` respectively.\n  - Added `generate_seo_node` for localized SEO keyword generation.\n- Extended reporting capabilities with `market_gap_report` and `seo_report`.\n- Simplified state transitions and improved error handling in the discovery workflow.\n- Enhanced logic to exclude specified farm names from competitor results and added geolocation support for market gap analysis.\n\nThese updates improve the agent''s functionality for competitor benchmarking and reporting, providing insights into local competition and SEO opportunities.","tree":{"sha":"bb4dfe9e0ffb8b2693d6ca1ec493cc1717a2fe13","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/bb4dfe9e0ffb8b2693d6ca1ec493cc1717a2fe13"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/af73f9031923cd94c99a45ff4eff83c7319a9878","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"h