/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/28e9ec35f0855901fad7e12e34f8be35ec625143/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:11Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T23:59:11Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): implement SDR agent for restaurant lead generation\n\n- Added a new SDR agent to automate restaurant lead generation and outreach.\n- Implemented stateful functions for workflow nodes including:\n  - `fetch_farm_context_node`: Retrieves farm details and inventory for keyword matching.\n  - `search_restaurants_node`: Leverages Google Places API to find restaurants near a specified location.\n  - `scrape_and_match_node`: Matches restaurants to farm inventory using website scraping and review analysis.\n  - `draft_emails_node`: Drafts outreach emails using LLMs and saves them to the database for human approval.\n- Constructed the SDR graph using `StateGraph` with defined entry and exit points, ensuring seamless node transitions.\n- Improved error handling across nodes to ensure robust workflows.\n- Streamlined email drafting via `ChatOpenAI` with personalized B2B messages and keyword-based recommendations.\n\nThis addition provides a scalable and automated framework for outreach, improving efficiency in connecting farms with local restaurants.","tree":{"sha":"7762d0439fc550488f099ee1dfa12b852dd11194","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/7762d0439fc550488f099ee1dfa