for farm discovery with Discovery Agent\n\n- Introduced a new API endpoint `/discover` to enable farm discovery using the Discovery Agent.\n- Utilized LangGraph to automate the process of finding, enriching, and auditing farm leads.\n- Integrated multi-step functionality, including querying USDA databases, enriching with Google Places, auditing digital presence, and storing high-priority targets.\n- Implemented robust error handling and validation for input parameters (zip code and state).\n- Returns a summary of results, including total leads found, audited, and target leads.\n\nThis addition extends the API capabilities for autonomous lead generation and digital outreach strategies.","tree":{"sha":"bd257445f5a9babea3c723ec4de86cab9d6a0e97","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/bd257445f5a9babea3c723ec4de86cab9d6a0e97"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/df6f9699e85b8b26c469814d3ff685557c0f336d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/df6f9699e85b8b26c469814d3ff685557c0f336d","node_id":"C_kwDORViF0doAKGRmNmY5Njk5ZTg1YjhiMjZjNDY5ODE0ZDNmZjY4NTU1N2MwZjMzNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9","sha":"a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9"}],"sha":"df6f9699e85b8b26c469814d3ff685557c0f336d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/df6f9699e85b8b26c469814d3ff685557c0f336d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:36Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:36Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(agents): add Discovery Agent workflow for automated lead identification\n\n- Implemented the `Discovery Agent` workflow using LangGraph to facilitate automated discovery and enrichment of farm leads.\n- Introduced integrated nodes for querying USDA APIs, enriching lead data with Google Places, and auditing websites'' digital health via AI-backed visual analysis.\n- Added functionality to save processed leads with poor digital health scores (<50) to a PostgreSQL database.\n- Constructed a graph-based structure with modular, async nodes: `search_usda`, `enrich_leads`, `audit_leads`, and `save_leads`.\n- Ensured extensibility by configuring a reusable workflow for lead discovery and targeting.\n\nThis update lays the foundation for automating outreach by identifying and improving digital visibility for underperforming farms.","tree":{"sha":"68a84e3d0717caafa037c602dc84e43cd07650b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/68a84e3d0717caafa037c602dc84e43cd07650b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9","node_id":"C_kwDORViF0doAKGExZGIyZjk0MGMyOGY0NGUzYzE4ODY5MWVmZjhlNzdjYmY5NDRlYTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508","sha":"23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508"}],"sha":"a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/a1db2f940c28f44e3c188691eff8e77cbf944ea9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:23Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:21:23Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(schemas): add Agent Discovery schemas for LangGraph workflows\n\n- Implemented `FarmLead`, `DiscoverySearchCriteria`, and `DiscoveryState` schemas to define the structure for agent discovery workflows in LangGraph.\n- Added detailed Pydantic models with field-level specifications for lead enrichment, search criteria, and workflow states.\n- Introduced default factories for list-based fields to ensure consistent initialization.\n- Enhanced modularity by placing the new schemas in `backend/src/schemas/agent_discovery.py`.","tree":{"sha":"748844bc61c0e7958cc26d41214cb837c6c3bdbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/748844bc61c0e7958cc26d41214cb837c6c3bdbb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508","node_id":"C_kwDORViF0doAKDIzZDRmMzUxOGNjYWNmODgyODcyZDU0ZjdhNDI2OGY5NTI3ODg1MDg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7","sha":"82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7"}],"sha":"23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/23d4f3518ccacf882872d54f7a4268f952788508"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:12:22Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T21:12:22Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(dependencies): add langgraph package to dependencies\n\n- Added `langgraph>=1.0.9` to `pyproject.toml` for enhanced graph-based language processing capabilities.\n- Updated `uv.lock` to include `langgraph`, along with its dependencies: `langchain-core`, `langgraph-checkpoint`, `langgraph-prebuilt`, `langgraph-sdk`, and `ormsgpack`.\n- Ensured version consistency and compatibility across newly added packages.","tree":{"sha":"738a6fcb5d3c0613938aebf9d4323c0ebb606a70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/738a6fcb5d3c0613938aebf9d4323c0ebb606a70"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7","node_id":"C_kwDORViF0doAKDgyZmJhNGY1Y2QwNjdlMGI2ZjY5YWYxMWRmNzkyMzU1ODNhM2UzYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commit/93ebff26e98b7475a8c13886a62c1a782727b064","sha":"93ebff26e98b7475a8c13886a62c1a782727b064","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/93ebff26e98b7475a8c13886a62c1a782727b064"}],"sha":"82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/82fba4f5cd067e0b6f69af11df79235583a3e3b7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/93ebff26e98b7475a8c13886a62c1a782727b064/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T20:59:08Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T20:59:08Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"message":"feat(tests): add comprehensive unit tests for new tools and APIs\n\n- Introduced unit tests for all newly implemented tools in `backend/tests/tools/`, including:\n  * Competitor analysis (`test_competitor_analysis.py`)\n  * Domain availability checker (`test_domain_availability.py`)\n  * Decision-maker email finder (`test_email_finder.py`)\n  * Local food events search (`test_events.py`)\n  * Google Places API integrations (`test_google_places_api.py`)\n  * LinkedIn profile search (`test_linkedin_finder.py`)\n  * Market news retrieval (`test_market_news.py`)\n  * Restaurant review analysis (`test_review_analyzer.py`)\n  * Local SEO keywords fetcher (`test_seo_tools.py`)\n  * Social media content scraper (`test_social_media.py`)\n  * USDA API integrations (`test_usda_api.py`)\n  * Weather data and forecasts (`test_weather.py`)\n  * Web scraping utilities (`test_web_scraper.py`)\n- Ensured usage of `pytest` fixtures, `respx` for mocking HTTP interactions, and dependency injection for consistent test isolation.\n- Validated schema-based responses for individual tools with robust assertions for all edge cases.\n- Improved test coverage for async functions and error handling paths.\n\nThis commit ensures all tools are well-tested and adhere to the project''s architectural standards.","tree":{"sha":"909c6a19c5012fdc5760c177eb3f1468c5a0a050","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/909c6a19c5012fdc5760c177eb3f1468c5a0a050"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/93ebff26e98b7475a8c13886a62c1a782727b064","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY