4f8f636f59eda6a2ed101c9472157a418e043","sha":"bf44f8f636f59eda6a2ed101c9472157a418e043","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/bf44f8f636f59eda6a2ed101c9472157a418e043"}],"sha":"a69fc77e3a37f12b5261350a33f158b685f998cd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/a69fc77e3a37f12b5261350a33f158b685f998cd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/commits/13fd39df681886ecca8e07de0f6c96da76801cd8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T20:36:47Z","email":"r.harikeshav@gmail.com","name":"Harikeshav R"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T20:36:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Merge pull request #8 from Harikeshav-R/feature/scraper\n\n## Summary\nThis PR implements the \"Market Intelligence\" tools required for Phase 3 of the Sprout architecture. It adds capabilities for fetching agricultural pricing, local weather forecasts, and food-related events. Additionally, it enforces a cleaner architecture by extracting Pydantic models (schemas) out of the tool definitions and into the `backend/src/schemas/` directory.\n\n## Key Changes\n\n### 1. New LangChain Tools (`backend/src/tools/`)\n*   **`market_news.py`**: Added `fetch_usda_ams_pricing` to retrieve wholesale commodity pricing (currently mocked/simplified for prototype).\n*   **`weather.py`**: Added `fetch_agricultural_weather` to get current weather and 5-day forecasts for farm locations (via OpenWeatherMap).\n*   **`events.py`**: Added `search_local_food_events` to find farmers markets and festivals near a ZIP code (via SerpApi).\n\n### 2. Configuration (`backend/src/core/config.py`)\n*   Added support for new environment variables:\n    *   `USDA_MARKET_NEWS_API_KEY` & `USDA_MARKET_NEWS_BASE_URL`\n    *   `WEATHER_API_KEY` & `WEATHER_API_BASE_URL`\n    *   `SERP_API_KEY` (reused for event search)\n\n### 3. Architecture & Refactoring\n*   **Schema Extraction**: Moved internal Pydantic models from tool files to dedicated schema modules in `backend/src/schemas/`:\n    *   `schemas/market_news.py`\n    *   `schemas/weather.py`\n    *   `schemas/events.py`\n*   **Exports**: Updated `backend/src/tools/__init__.py` to export the new tools and their corresponding schemas, ensuring they are ready for use in LangGraph agents.\n\n## Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Verify `fetch_usda_ams_pricing` returns valid `MarketPriceResult`.\n- [ ] Verify `fetch_agricultural_weather` correctly hits the OpenWeatherMap API (or mock).\n- [ ] Verify `search_local_food_events` correctly parses SerpApi results.\n- [ ] Ensure all new environment variables are set in `.env` (or `docker-compose.yml`).","tree":{"sha":"758fb9b63d38b6986799dd734963949ed10b1ce1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/758fb9b63d38b6986799dd734963949ed10b1ce1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/13fd39df681886ecca8e07de0f6c96da76801cd8","verification":{"payload":"tree 758fb9b63d38b6986799dd734963949ed10b1ce1\nparent e68f9beaf313a977f4817838e057c10bcf837b70\nparent 41b3ccacf3f151df019d754e40cf2242c546ea21\nauthor Harikeshav R <r.harikeshav@gmail.com> 1771706207 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1771706207 -0500\n\nMerge pull request #8 from Harikeshav-R/feature/scraper\n\n## Summary\nThis PR implements the \"Market Intelligence\" tools required for Phase 3 of the Sprout architecture. It adds capabilities for fetching agricultural pricing, local weather forecasts, and food-related events. Additionally, it enforces a cleaner architecture by extracting Pydantic models (schemas) out of the tool definitions and into the `backend/src/schemas/` directory.\n\n## Key Changes\n\n### 1. New LangChain Tools (`backend/src/tools/`)\n*   **`market_news.py`**: Added `fetch_usda_ams_pricing` to retrieve wholesale commodity pricing (currently mocked/simplified for prototype).\n*   **`weather.py`**: Added `fetch_agricultural_weather` to get current weather and 5-day forecasts for farm locations (via OpenWeatherMap).\n*   **`events.py`**: Added `search_local_food_events` to find farmers markets and festivals near a ZIP code (via SerpApi).\n\n### 2. Configuration (`backend/src/core/config.py`)\n*   Added support for new environment variables:\n    *   `USDA_MARKET_NEWS_API_KEY` & `USDA_MARKET_NEWS_BASE_URL`\n    *   `WEATHER_API_KEY` & `WEATHER_API_BASE_URL`\n    *   `SERP_API_KEY` (reused for event search)\n\n### 3. Architecture & Refactoring\n*   **Schema Extraction**: Moved internal Pydantic models from tool files to dedicated schema modules in `backend/src/schemas/`:\n    *   `schemas/market_news.py`\n    *   `schemas/weather.py`\n    *   `schemas/events.py`\n*   **Exports**: Updated `backend/src/tools/__init__.py` to export the new tools and their corresponding schemas, ensuring they are ready for use in LangGraph agents.\n\n## Testing Checklist\n- [ ] Verify `fetch_usda_ams_pricing` returns valid `MarketPriceResult`.\n- [ ] Verify `fetch_agricultural_weather` correctly hits the OpenWeatherMap API (or mock).\n- [ ] Verify `search_local_food_events` correctly parses SerpApi results.\n- [ ] Ensure all new environment variables are set in `.env` (or `docker-compose.yml`).","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpmhdfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXmgQAC90FG1TnmxHS2f4pCP2fRRY\nddgLsYpP1iI1PQoncWZBkfuRLwK3oBfga8XN5Ha1Ce/qbN7scjmvohgOoKwfjvq9\nd4+bOHxEkzgMkxOdOsVMhltHwwOHR+bztmjWbm6jj2KP+cqJr9AXaQ6LHRsJIhpW\n5bqhnvyi1wUU8qnmzr/g3d9O+uq3FB/FT1wqfuE9x/U9VKQCSjUjjOtvHZac+uUo\n0fuQusGevOcOyuNbS74LSEV5BlHg31F3QKINB1o1sM8aLqfpUFDJy3i9fJQO1P0I\n1NtyX1/bGqBAvf4HdS2pQSwtbmn4w7YtjcKvjqmizmR2bcxhty3C6oRXbF5oruS1\nIG7UGTb8r+8KZZT6qf7Eujt/q3ZNXNoaI8m8H3rf6v/wf5HE/JzgtZgrnfEPB2Mt\ni5JXIOgxkTEskS/EDlTDzAAsBeWrMB7nDyiOP+9TYlOaN7DNsuMosBjwW+mMBDcR\nFyZ+R4jyWMBsG0MGEadL9avT0DloeMcKovphHsg37Hygj6o+EdlqS0xwGYB7aOoS\nVel1nNn+JA0Myv2Gi2Y8911fr0dMx6gH1aDpOxCt2x6zotjs8kouP3Xz9OCmI+mr\nuzUgPczuqxSbQBrlxRskk5Zj6WjUQsseB3wju4deQzocKTO1x5lLffaZP4I3T+8l\njt6n3MoX114ohp05+Js3\n=k+By\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-21T20:36:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url