r organization.\n- Ensured `farm_id` validation and error handling in `create_transaction`, `create_inventory`, and `create_outreach_email` endpoints.\n- Standardized indentation and formatting across modules for consistency.\n- Updated import paths in API and CRUD layers to reflect schema relocation.\n\nThis update removes the redundant `schemas/farm.py` file by integrating its contents (`FarmCreate` and `FarmRead`) into the `models/farm.py` file, reducing duplication and improving structure. Enhanced validation for `farm_id` fields across multiple endpoints prevents unexpected database errors. The codebase now follows a consistent formatting style, and all related import paths have been updated accordingly.","tree":{"sha":"2e0f82de80c1f9a275373557a574074b975abfc4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/trees/2e0f82de80c1f9a275373557a574074b975abfc4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Harikeshav-R/Sprout/git/commits/0a76fb4f6e024cc3fa2ee304a9b179b9fd5681b9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/63719951?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Harikeshav-R","id":63719951,"login":"Harikeshav-R","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYzNzE5OTUx","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Harikeshav-R/subscripti