covery → collection → single-layer rule → validation → env check → report)\n- Automated validation script (live endpoints + static configs, zero dependencies)\n- 5 architecture patterns (same-origin, cross-origin, gateway-proxied, micro-app, multi-consumer)\n- 30+ audit checklist items with pass/fail criteria\n- Caddy and Nginx configuration examples\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"09518e1a6eff388f69db956729d8acd384141a4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psylch/cors-audit-skill/git/trees/09518e1a6eff388f69db956729d8acd384141a4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/psylch/cors-audit-skill/git/commits/5f83a277ae769865a69cf004fec307b5da125672","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113290241?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/psylch","id":113290241,"login":"psylch","node_id":"U_kgDOBsCsAQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/psylch","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/psylch/cors-audit-skill/commit/5f83a277ae769865a69cf004fec307b5da125672","node_id":"C_kwDORVjRx9oAKDVmODNhMjc3YWU3Njk4NjVhNjljZjAwNGZlYzMwN2I1ZGExMjU2NzI","parents":[],"sha":"5f83a277ae769865a69cf004fec307b5da125672","url":"https://api.github.com/rep