/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/ed07cc201b5e2ce2cd0032f20a02618b8996c0d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T22:55:20Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T22:55:20Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"chore: flatten dashboard-goap/ to repo root\n\nMove all project code from dashboard-goap/dashboard/ to the repository\nroot, eliminating the unnecessary two-level nesting. No import paths\nchange since all imports are relative within server/, orchestrator/,\nsrc/, shared/.\n\nStructural changes:\n- server/, orchestrator/, src/, shared/, __tests__/, migrations/ to root\n- Config files (package.json, tsconfig, Dockerfile, docker-compose,\n  vite, tailwind, postcss, bunfig, .env.example, start.sh) to root\n- Delete stale dashboard-goap/ wrapper (its root-level package.json,\n  tsconfig, Dockerfile, docker-compose were duplicates that diverged)\n- Merge .gitignore: add dist/, .env, .env.local, *.log, .DS_Store\n- Add .dockerignore at root\n\nOrchestrator fixes included in moved files:\n\n  fix(orchestrator): use claude -p for execution, not claude-flow\n\n  claude-flow agent spawn only registers metadata in a JSON store --\n  it does NOT spawn a process or execute code. It is a coordination/MCP\n  layer, not an execution engine. Switch useClaudeFlow default to false\n  so agents execute via `claude -p --model sonnet` which actually runs\n  Claude Code in non-interactive mode.\n\n  fix(orchestrator): claim issue before spawning agent\n\n  Previously: spawn agent then claim issue. If the claim returned 409,\n  the agent was already running untracked (zombie). Now: generate\n  agentId upfront, claim via API, then spawn agent. If spawn fails\n  after claiming, the claim is released automatically.\n\n  fix(orchestrator): suppress pong/heartbeat WebSocket debug noise\n\n  Filter pong and orchestrator:heartbeat messages from dashboard-client\n  debug log output. These fire every few seconds and drown out useful\n  messages.\n\n  fix(orchestrator): remove haiku model tier, sonnet is minimum\n\n  Haiku is too weak for Claude CLI agent tasks that require tool use\n  (file reading, editing, git). Remove the low-complexity indicator\n  that routed tasks like \"README\" to haiku. All tasks now route to\n  sonnet minimum; high-complexity indicators upgrade to opus.\n\n  fix(orchestrator): reset worktrees and symlink config files\n\n  - Reset existing worktrees to clean state on reuse with\n    git checkout . && git clean -fd to prevent stale changes from\n    a previous agent confusing the new one.\n  - Symlink .mcp.json, CLAUDE.md, .claude/, .claude-flow/, .swarm/\n    into worktrees so agents have full project context and MCP tools.\n  - Use simple model aliases (sonnet/haiku/opus) instead of dated\n    full names like claude-sonnet-4-6-20250627 which don''t exist.\n\n  fix(server): auto-clear claimant when status moves to backlog\n\n  validateClaimState() now clears the claimant field when a claim''s\n  status is set to \"backlog\". Previously, dragging a card back to\n  backlog in the UI kept the old claimant, causing 409 Conflict when\n  the orchestrator tried to re-claim it.\n\n  feat(scripts): add concurrently --names for labeled dev output\n\n  Replace anonymous [0]/[1]/[2] prefixes with --names api,ui (and\n  api,ui,orch for dev:all) so console output shows which process\n  each log line comes from.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8ffc12b26abc683b66d6077bfef1aa202682d54b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/8ffc12b26abc683b66d6077bfef1aa202682d54b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/ed07cc201b5e2ce2cd0032f20a02618b8996c0d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/ed07cc201b5e2ce2cd0032f20a02618b8996c0d2","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKGVkMDdjYzIwMWI1ZTJjZTJjZDAwMzJmMjBhMDI2MThiODk5NmMwZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/1fc561be712194d145029c792a9a213bfc6650a4","sha":"1fc561be712194d145029c792a9a213bfc6650a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos