tea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/437ab56584df0ca2cc47d352bc933a598b886c18/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T04:04:16Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T04:04:16Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): agent lifecycle callback and needs_review status\n\n- Add AgentLifecycleEvent types and callback to AgentSpawner\n- Emit lifecycle events directly to orchestrator when agents complete/fail\n- Change completed agent status from \"completed\" to \"needs_review\"\n  (tasks need human approval before being marked completed)\n- This fixes the capacity issue where completed agents weren''t being\n  removed from activeAgents\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bccbee4ff852b13abff2ec1cb96e695941f4b62","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/1bccbee4ff852b13abff2ec1cb96e695941f4b62"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/437ab56584df0ca2cc47d352bc933a598b886c18","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nat