tps://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/4aab05cdaad1ef6983872b3b73ae6c1633670c34/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:57:35Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:57:35Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): set agent claimant when claiming issues\n\nThe orchestrator was calling updateClaimStatus() which only sets status\nand progress, but not the claimant. Claims need a claimant with\ntype=\"agent\" to appear in the \"Agent Working\" column on the frontend.\n\nChanges:\n- Update claimIssue() to accept AgentClaimant object instead of string\n- Orchestrator now calls claimIssue() with proper agent claimant info\n  after spawning the agent (to have the agentId available)\n- The /api/claims/:id/claim endpoint sets both claimant and status\n\nThis ensures claims show up in the correct Kanban column when agents\nare working on them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"11a091a650028e5f24e82e7d5899ac8bd318a36a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/11a091a650028e5f24e82e7d5899ac8bd318a36a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/4aab05cdaad1ef6983872b3b73ae6c1633670c34","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/4aab05cdaad1ef6983872b3b73ae6c1633670c34","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKDRhYWIwNWNkYWFkMWVmNjk4Mzg3MmIzYjczYWU2YzE2MzM2NzBjMzQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753","sha":"8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753"}],"sha":"4aab05cdaad1ef6983872b3b73ae6c1633670c34","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/4aab05cdaad1ef6983872b3b73ae6c1633670c34"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:54:03Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:54:03Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"feat(dashboard): add WebSocket broadcast for claim updates\n\nClaims were not updating in real-time on the frontend because the\nWebSocket broadcast was never being called from the claims routes.\nThe hub.broadcast() method existed but was never invoked.\n\nChanges:\n- Add WebSocket broadcast calls to all claim mutation routes\n- Import hub and event types in claims routes\n- Add helper functions: broadcastClaimCreated, broadcastClaimUpdated,\n  broadcastClaimDeleted\n- Fix event type naming: use dot notation (claim.updated) consistently\n  between server and frontend (was using underscores on frontend)\n- Update frontend ClaimEvent type to match server event types\n- Update useWebSocket hook to handle claim.updated events\n- Fix package.json build script to use --target=bun for server build\n\nThis enables real-time claim status updates on the frontend when the\norchestrator claims issues and updates their status.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"425d3c0ae862603d107c950da696c97a45afb434","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/425d3c0ae862603d107c950da696c97a45afb434"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKDhmYjE3MTdmZDdiZDVjNWFiOWFhNjhlZjY3YTVhZTM2OTk2NjM3NTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac","sha":"c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac"}],"sha":"8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/8fb1717fd7bd5c5ab9aa68ef67a5ae3699663753"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:49:01Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:49:01Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): use valid Claude Code agent types\n\nReplace invalid \"debugger\" agent type with \"coder\" throughout the\norchestrator. Claude Code only supports these agent types: coder,\nresearcher, tester, reviewer, architect, coordinator, analyst,\noptimizer, security-architect, security-auditor, memory-specialist,\nswarm-specialist, performance-engineer, core-architect, test-architect.\n\nChanges:\n- Update AgentType in domain/types.ts to match valid Claude Code types\n- Update LABEL_AGENT_MAP in task-router.ts: bug/fix/debug labels → coder\n- Update TITLE_PATTERNS in task-router.ts: bug-related patterns → coder\n- Update normalizeAgentType mapping: debugger/debug/fixer → coder\n- Add new agent types: security-architect, security-auditor,\n  memory-specialist, swarm-specialist, performance-engineer,\n  core-architect, test-architect\n- Update test expectation for bug routing to expect \"coder\"\n\nThis fixes the runtime error:\n\"Invalid value for --type: debugger. Must be one of: coder, researcher...\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90ac60b4ce1677402246fc1e72d2d3189d9767e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/90ac60b4ce1677402246fc1e72d2d3189d9767e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKGM0Njc3ZGE4MWNhMzdiMmVhMmRmNmNiOWJkMDg2OGJjMTIxNmVjYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb","sha":"7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb"}],"sha":"c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/c4677da81ca37b2ea2df6cb9bd0868bc1216ecac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:45:26Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:45:26Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"fix(orchestrator): fix API response parsing and add agent hooks endpoint\n\nThe orchestrator was failing with \"undefined is not an object\n(evaluating ''claim.createdAt'')\" because dashboard-client.ts expected\nAPI responses wrapped as { claim: Claim } but the dashboard server\nreturns claims directly.\n\nAdditionally, agents were reporting \"Hook request failed: 404 Not Found\"\nbecause the /api/hooks/agent endpoint didn''t exist - the hooks routes\nwere defined but never mounted in the server.\n\nChanges:\n\ndashboard-client.ts:\n- Fix fetchClaim() to expect Claim directly instead of { claim: Claim }\n- Fix claimIssue() to expect Claim directly instead of { claim: Claim }\n- Fix updateClaimStatus() to expect Claim directly instead of { claim: Claim }\n- Add clarifying comments about API response format\n\nserver/index.ts:\n- Import and mount hooksRoutes at /api/hooks\n- Enables all hook endpoints including the new /api/hooks/agent\n\nserver/routes/hooks.ts:\n- Add POST /api/hooks/agent endpoint for orchestrator agent lifecycle events\n- Accepts payload with agentId, claimId, issueId, event, progress, error\n- Validates with Zod schema (agentHookSchema)\n- Converts to HookPayload format and processes through event aggregator\n- Logs agent events for observability\n\nThe orchestrator can now:\n- Successfully update claim status without parseClaimDates errors\n- Report agent lifecycle events (started, progress, completed, failed)\n- Integrate with the dashboard''s event aggregation system\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"06240c850feac0e043bb21416dc4314f0cb5ffeb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/06240c850feac0e043bb21416dc4314f0cb5ffeb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKDdiNmJkZmFiODIwOTlkMTdhMTQ3ZTYxNDMzYjAxZTA0YzI5MmIxZWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637","sha":"1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637"}],"sha":"7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/7b6bdfab82099d17a147e61433b01e04c292b1eb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:33:48Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:33:48Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"chore(dashboard): ignore runtime state directories\n\nAdd .claude-flow/ and .swarm/ to gitignore.\nThese directories contain runtime state (memory store, metrics,\ndaemon state) that is generated during execution.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6509bcad275402bca23f1f7fea3cc7fc010f7116","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/6509bcad275402bca23f1f7fea3cc7fc010f7116"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKDFmM2Y5Y2IzNWQ3NTY5MDM1YTE1MzY1MDc1Yzk5ZTEzODdhMDc2Mzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/247f8c9acc2f43a427e461235b4fdd02ee5a3a59","sha":"247f8c9acc2f43a427e461235b4fdd02ee5a3a59","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/247f8c9acc2f43a427e461235b4fdd02ee5a3a59"}],"sha":"1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/1f3f9cb35d7569035a15365075c99e1387a07637"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/247f8c9acc2f43a427e461235b4fdd02ee5a3a59/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:33:37Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:33:37Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"feat(dashboard): add Agent Orchestrator for autonomous claim processing\n\nImplement CLI adapter that bridges Claims Dashboard with Claude-Flow swarm:\n\nOrchestrator core (orchestrator/orchestrator.ts):\n- State machine: idle -> running -> paused -> stopped\n- Pool management with configurable max concurrent agents\n- WebSocket connection to dashboard for backlog events\n- Retry logic with exponential backoff\n\nDashboard client (orchestrator/dashboard-client.ts):\n- WebSocket connection with auto-reconnect\n- HTTP client for claims API\n- Snapshot and event handling\n\nTask router (orchestrator/task-router.ts):\n- Calls claude-flow hooks pre-task for routing\n- Returns agent type and model tier recommendations\n- Supports 3-tier model routing (haiku/sonnet/opus)\n\nAgent spawner (orchestrator/agent-spawner.ts):\n- Wraps claude-flow CLI commands\n- Spawns agents via swarm system\n- Tracks agent lifecycle\n\nConfiguration (orchestrator/config.ts):\n- ORCHESTRATOR_MAX_AGENTS: Pool size (default: 4)\n- ORCHESTRATOR_MAX_RETRIES: Retry limit (default: 2)\n- ORCHESTRATOR_RETRY_DELAY_MS: Backoff delay\n\nCLI entry point (orchestrator/index.ts):\n- bun run orchestrator to start\n\nTests (orchestrator/orchestrator.test.ts):\n- State machine transitions\n- Pool capacity management\n- Retry behavior\n\nPart of GOAP Milestone 8: Agent Orchestrator\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90ed82700ffe8ce89675a0ce791e1edc7712c8c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/90ed82700ffe8ce89675a0ce791e1edc7712c8c6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/247f8c9acc2f43a427e461235b4fdd02ee5a3a59","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/247f8c9acc2f43a427e461235b4fdd02ee5a3a59","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKDI0N2Y4YzlhY2MyZjQzYTQyN2U0NjEyMzViNGZkZDAyZWU1YTNhNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/75014f7a2153bb50a09716829edabdaaa2e2c0ca","sha":"75014f7a2153bb50a09716829edabdaaa2e