):\n- Monitoring: status, agents, swarm-monitor\n- Automation: smart-spawn, workflow-select\n- GitHub: code-review, pr-enhance, issue-triage\n- Optimization: parallel-execute, topology-optimize\n\nSkills (.claude/skills/):\n- agentdb-*: Vector database patterns\n- github-*: Repository management\n- v3-*: Claude-flow v3 implementation\n- sparc-methodology: SPARC development workflow\n\nSettings:\n- .claude/settings.json: Project configuration\n- .claude/settings.local.json: Local overrides\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"836a8ae3c8eec9dfe2d07cde8791a0dfeb8e48cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/836a8ae3c8eec9dfe2d07cde8791a0dfeb8e48cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/d49bdfce3969266db9a78a3e41b6a4afcca2b1e1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/natea/cf-dashboard/commit/d49bdfce3969266db9a78a3e41b6a4afcca2b1e1","node_id":"C_kwDORVkAJNoAKGQ0OWJkZmNlMzk2OTI2NmRiOWE3OGEzZTQx