rl":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/3e94bb944a89fc6a64b7e0f2d2f6ac75b147a3e2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:31:28Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:31:28Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"feat(dashboard/server): add GitHub issue synchronization\n\nImplement periodic GitHub issue sync:\n\nSync service (server/github/sync.ts):\n- Configurable owner/repo/labels from env\n- 60-second polling interval\n- Idempotent import (no duplicates)\n- Maps GitHub issues to Claims with source: ''github''\n- Preserves GitHub metadata (number, labels, author, assignees)\n\nGitHub types (server/github/types.ts):\n- GitHubIssue interface\n- Sync configuration types\n\nFeatures:\n- Label-based filtering (e.g., ''ready'', ''claims'')\n- Closed issue handling\n- Error recovery with retry\n\nPart of GOAP Milestone 6: Integrations\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c4e8db8cbc5ac87176acb38836604cc3bda4a43e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/c4e8db8cbc5ac87176acb38836604cc3bda4a43e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/3e94bb944a89fc6a64b7e0f2d2f6ac75b147a3e2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/118984?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/followers","following_url":"