github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/28e5748a96a6fb9beba994e04e1f4b682008278d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:30:45Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:30:45Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"feat(dashboard/server): implement storage backends (memory, SQLite, Postgres)\n\nAdd three storage implementations following the adapter pattern:\n\nMemory storage (server/storage/memory.ts):\n- In-memory Map with nanoid keys\n- Full CRUD with filtering support\n- Useful for testing and development\n\nSQLite storage (server/storage/sqlite.ts):\n- Bun''s built-in SQLite driver\n- JSON serialization for complex fields\n- Auto-migration on init\n\nPostgreSQL storage (server/storage/postgres.ts):\n- postgres.js client with connection pooling\n- JSONB for claimant and metadata\n- Prepared statements for security\n\nStorage factory (server/storage/index.ts):\n- Environment-based backend selection\n- Graceful connection handling\n\nAdd comprehensive tests for each backend.\n\nPart of GOAP Milestone 2: Backend Core\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"70e0ec04fe53e121ae803247c350ef517bd9693e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/70e0ec04fe53e121ae803247c350ef517bd9693e"},"url":"https://