rl":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/natea","id":118984,"login":"natea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/17b6ef6da1080b56a206e0a5bcd8f284e3ef3669/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:30:32Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:30:32Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"feat(dashboard/server): define domain types and storage interface\n\nImplement Domain-Driven Design layer for Claims:\n\nDomain types (server/domain/types.ts):\n- ClaimStatus: backlog | active | paused | blocked | review-requested | completed\n- ClaimSource: github | manual | mcp\n- Claimant: discriminated union (human | agent)\n- Claim: aggregate root with full lifecycle\n\nStorage interface (server/storage/interface.ts):\n- ClaimsStorage: CRUD + filtering contract\n- ClaimFilter: query by status, source, claimant type\n- CreateClaimInput/UpdateClaimInput: typed mutations\n\nAdd unit tests for domain type validation.\n\nPart of GOAP Milestone 2: Backend Core\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"467e6cd33fcb7c4dba967652a83170475e047d5c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/467e6cd33fcb7c4dba967652a83170475e047d5c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/commits/17b6ef6da1080b56a206e0a5bcd8f284e3ef3669","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":