atea","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExODk4NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/natea","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/commits/b6ba86606a9fc4164f36435d2b0bb7b338f6db43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:30:19Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T03:30:19Z","email":"natejaune@gmail.com","name":"Nate Aune"},"message":"docs(dashboard): add architecture decisions and GOAP implementation plan\n\nDocument architectural decisions for the Claims Dashboard:\n\nADR-001: Dashboard Architecture\n- Bun + Hono server with React SPA\n- Horizontal scaling with sticky sessions\n\nADR-002: Claims Persistence\n- PostgreSQL primary, SQLite fallback\n- Storage adapter pattern for swappable backends\n\nADR-003: Real-time Events\n- WebSocket with room-based subscriptions\n- Postgres LISTEN/NOTIFY for change detection\n\nADR-004: Frontend Architecture\n- Zustand for state management\n- Optimistic updates with rollback\n\nADR-005: Deployment\n- Docker Compose for local development\n- Health checks and graceful shutdown\n\nADR-006: GitHub Integration\n- Periodic sync with label filtering\n- Idempotent issue import\n\nPlanning documents:\n- GOAP implementation plan with 36 actions across 8 milestones\n- Domain model with Claim aggregate and value objects\n- Claims Dashboard design specification\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a7196c0fa51a47f0433cb35d2da1a0c9a98c8936","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/natea/cf-dashboard/git/trees/a7196c0fa51a47f0433cb35