{"login":"jensenbox","providerType":"User"},"email":"christian@closient.com","name":"Christian Jensen"},"authoredDate":"2026-02-21T18:50:24Z","committedDate":"2026-02-21T18:50:24Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"jensenbox","providerType":"User"},"email":"christian@closient.com","name":"Christian Jensen"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:55:45.171Z","repositoryId":1163515818,"sha":"15bb970f7b399483f6115f19b39d47b7e6608418"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T21:55:45.171Z","raw":[{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7526760?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jprokopowich","id":7526760,"login":"jprokopowich","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1MjY3NjA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jprokopowich","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jensenbox/ha-arctic-spa/commits/395a752311142592b10b33ec2f6722eb5268a285/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:00:10Z","email":"jprokopowich@gmail.com","name":"umproko5"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T01:00:10Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"add pump 3 (#50)\n\n* Update switch.py\n\nAdding pump 3\n\n* Update api.py\n\nadding pump 3\n\n* Update sensor.py\n\nadding pump 3\n\n* Update switch.py\n\nadded pump 3\n\n* Update api.py\n\nadded pump 3\n\n* Update number.py\n\nlower minimum temp to 59 .... useful when slowly bring temp back up when refilling.\n\n* Update pump_id tests for pump 3 support\n\n* Update binary_sensor.py\n\nupdated to support pump 3\n\n* Fix pump3_running binary sensor to read pump3, not pump2\n\nCopy-paste from the pump2 entry above it -- the lambda checked\nd.get(\"pump2\") instead of d.get(\"pump3\"), so the new binary sensor\nwould have mirrored Pump 2''s running state instead of Pump 3''s.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Christian <christian@closient.com>","tree":{"sha":"89d233499f3bd80225be4623e9776074f94d93e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jensenbox/ha-arctic-spa/git/trees/89d233499f3bd80225be4623e9776074f94d93e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jensenbox/ha-arctic-spa/git/commits/395a752311142592b10b33ec2f6722eb5268a285","verification":{"payload":"tree 89d233499f3bd80225be4623e9776074f94d93e0\nparent ed987712d43f8eae53180e0cea5ddb302aee08b7\nauthor umproko5 <jprokopowich@gmail.com> 1789606810 -0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789606810 -0700\n\nadd pump 3 (#50)\n\n* Update switch.py\n\nAdding pump 3\n\n* Update api.py\n\nadding pump 3\n\n* Update sensor.py\n\nadding pump 3\n\n* Update switch.py\n\nadded pump 3\n\n* Update api.py\n\nadded pump 3\n\n* Update number.py\n\nlower minimum temp to 59 .... useful when slowly bring temp back up when refilling.\n\n* Update pump_id tests for pump 3 support\n\n* Update binary_sensor.py\n\nupdated to support pump 3\n\n* Fix pump3_running binary sensor to read pump3, not pump2\n\nCopy-paste from the pump2 entry above it -- the lambda checked\nd.get(\"pump2\") instead of d.get(\"pump3\"), so the new binary sensor\nwould have mirrored Pump 2''s running state instead of Pump 3''s.\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Christian <christian@closient.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqzuaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzRMQACNV5mYqYK45R3a0c9ocfMWV\nbXJ1/AMIw7+e2zbzZupdUV1ZqE65iNUJsme