e":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jensenbox/ha-arctic-spa/commits/7cce1a4563a04741c5d9f3b85001c9a534939e22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-21T19:11:03Z","email":"christian@closient.com","name":"Christian Jensen"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-21T19:11:03Z","email":"christian@closient.com","name":"Christian Jensen"},"message":"feat(#5,#7,#8,#9,#10,#14): HA compliance modernization and enhancements\n\n- #5: hacs.json — removed invalid `domains`/`iot_class` fields; added\n  `zip_release: true` so HACS uses the release zip artifact\n- #7: sensor.py, number.py — use UnitOfTemperature.FAHRENHEIT and\n  UnitOfTime.HOURS constants for proper HA unit conversion\n- #8: reauth flow — coordinator now raises ConfigEntryAuthFailed on 401;\n  config_flow adds async_step_reauth + async_step_reauth_confirm so users\n  can update an expired API key without removing the integration; strings\n  and translations updated with reauth step and abort reason\n- #9: migrated from hass.data[DOMAIN] to entry.runtime_data across all\n  platform files; coordinator now accepts config_entry param; removed\n  redundant device registry registration from __init__.py; simplified\n  async_unload_entry\n- #10: added EntityCategory.DIAGNOSTIC to connectivity, error, filter\n  status, and chemistry status entities; EntityCategory.CONFIG to\n  filtration controls and boost mode\n- #14: replaced mdi:chemical-weapon with mdi:flask on SpaBoy Producing;\n  config_flow now uses HA-managed aiohttp session for consistency\n\nCloses #5, #7, #8, #9, #10, #14","tree":{"sha":"d3ff38e0b2070ff9d9a5c717da4eaf42e5eb16b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jensenbox/ha-arctic-spa/git/trees/d3ff38e0b2070ff9d9a5c717da4eaf42e5eb16b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jensenbox/ha-arctic-spa/git/commits/7cce1a4563a04741c5d9f3b85001c9a534939e22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar