s","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-20T04:21:05Z","email":"markmorgan.dev@gmail.com","name":"markmdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-20T04:21:05Z","email":"markmorgan.dev@gmail.com","name":"markmdev"},"message":"feat: add A2UI Widget Builder with bug fixes\n\nWidget Builder (/widget-builder):\n- Create view with AI-powered widget generation\n- Gallery with 15 pre-built templates\n- Components documentation for all 18 A2UI components\n- Icons reference with 100+ Material Icons\n- Monaco JSON editor with live preview\n- localStorage persistence for saved widgets\n\nBug fixes:\n- Chat sidebar only visible in editor view (not Create/Gallery/Components/Icons)\n- Create flow auto-sends description to A2UI agent\n- Fixed duplicate ''share'' and ''cloud'' icon keys\n- Changed Text.all color from lilac to neutral gray\n- Updated theme with improved typography and border radii\n\nTechnical:\n- ChatContent component uses @copilotkitnext/react hooks\n- 100ms delay for context initialization after provider mount","tree":{"sha":"37e13ac5fc4821598156c9e8e82de22baf4189c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Buildathon26/StreamUI-Impulso/git/trees/37e13ac5fc4821598156c9e8e82de22baf4189c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Buildathon26/StreamUI-Impulso/git/commits/67930dd9911992bf2219a2c6d2fae66c3139cb49","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186849302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/markmdev","id":186849302,"login":"markmdev","node_id":"U_kgDOCyMYFg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/orgs","received_even