om/repos/Buildathon26/StreamUI-Impulso/commits/ed1500789d2e114a5245459023269b12c30d0cfb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-19T21:14:25Z","email":"markmorgan.dev@gmail.com","name":"markmdev"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-19T21:14:25Z","email":"markmorgan.dev@gmail.com","name":"markmdev"},"message":"feat: UI Protocols Demo with three generative UI approaches\n\nImplements a comprehensive demo showcasing three protocols for AI-powered UIs:\n\n1. Static GenUI - Pre-built React components rendered via useRenderToolCall\n   and useHumanInTheLoop hooks (WeatherCard, StockCard, TaskApprovalCard)\n\n2. MCP Apps - HTML/JS apps served by MCP server, rendered in sandboxed iframes\n   (Flights, Hotels, Trading, Kanban, Calculator, Todo)\n\n3. A2UI - Agent-composed declarative JSON UI via Python A2A agent\n   (Forms, Lists, Cards, Confirmations)\n\nKey features:\n- Agent switching between Static+MCP and A2UI modes\n- Protocol card pills with auto-switch mode on click\n- Pending message pattern for cross-provider message sending\n- A2UI theming with lilac/mint palette matching mcp-apps\n- Educational comparison table explaining protocol tradeoffs","tree":{"sha":"c561851444f20a738169af6dd28b5a44a98116e9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Buildathon26/StreamUI-Impulso/git/trees/c561851444f20a738169af6dd28b5a44a98116e9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Buildathon26/StreamUI-Impulso/git/commits/ed1500789d2e114a5245459023269b12c30d0cfb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/186849302?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/markmdev/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/markm