Viewport: 1366x768 desktop resolution\n- Diffing: pixelmatch with 0.1% tolerance\n- Storage: Git LFS for efficient baseline management\n- Coverage: Alert (9), Badge (9), Button (11), Card (7), DatePicker (10),\n  Dropdown (11), Input (13), Modal (5), Spinner (5), Tabs (5)\n\nConfiguration Changes:\n- package.json: Added loki config, updated npm scripts (loki:test, loki:update,\n  loki:serve, visual-test)\n- .gitattributes: Git LFS tracking for .loki/reference/**/*.png\n- .gitignore: Exclude .loki/current/, .loki/difference/, .loki/.cache/\n\nValidation Completed:\n✅ All 85 baseline screenshots generated\n✅ Visual regressio✅ Visual r (clean state)\n✅ Change detection works (tested with Button m✅ Change detection works (tested with Button m✅ Chaent✅ Change detection works (tested with Button m✅ C00✅ Change detection works (tested wig now operational.","tree":{"sha":"2afe01c73b5da98a81b66d042fd7f12b755c8d14","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bluetorch/mtsynergy-platform-design-system/git/trees/2afe01c73b5da98a81b66d042fd7f12b755c8d14"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bluetorch/mtsynergy-platform-design-system/git/commits/09c64365339e7a7d6255611a8399cc33fdb89e93","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3129411?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bluetorch","id":3129411,"login":"bluetorch","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxMjk0MTE=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bluetorch/repos","site_admin":f