9c04da7ee52777/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:00:16Z","email":"mrohan171093@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:00:16Z","email":"mrohan171093@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: enhance customer pagination handling and default values\n\n- Updated `parseCustomersSearchParams` to use default page size when not provided.\n- Modified `autocompleteCustomers` to apply default limit for autocomplete queries.\n\nchore: update official documentation and release notes\n\n- Changed last checked date and label for documentation.\n- Added new release notes for Better Auth 1.7.7 and TanStack Query cancellation.\n\nrefactor: streamline server state management in ServerState component\n\n- Replaced manual query and mutation handling with reusable query options.\n- Improved error handling for mutation failures.\n\nfix: improve server table pagination and filtering logic\n\n- Adjusted pagination logic to handle placeholder data correctly.\n- Removed unnecessary refresh key state management.\n\nfix: enhance authentication session handling in server\n\n- Updated `getRequestSession` to disable cookie cache for immediate revocation.\n- Refactored authentication loader to handle session retrieval errors.\n\ntest: add unit tests for customer table and platform signals query\n\n- Implemented tests for pagination defaults in customer table.\n- Added tests for platform signals query and mutation behaviors.\n\nchore: create production server setup and smoke tests\n\n- Established production server entry point and static file handling.\n- Implemented smoke tests to validate production readiness and asset serving.","tree":{"sha":"cd9e6c128c605ea9493d509033d21169deab79ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanpradev/React-19/git/trees/cd9e6c128c605ea9493d509033d21169deab79ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohanpradev/React-19/git/commits/17bd246f92cc65f67064371ecd9c04da7ee52777","verification":{"payload":null,"reas