:{"date":"2026-02-22T19:46:43Z","email":"danieldwalford@gmail.com","name":"dandwal"},"message":"fix: safe kill-port in dev:all script\n\nInstead of blindly killing whatever is on port 7357, scripts/dev.mjs now:\n1. Checks if port 7357 is in use\n2. If yes, fetches /api/status to verify it''s a FedPrism server\n3. Only runs npx kill-port if verification succeeds\n4. Otherwise, aborts cleanly and tells the developer the port is blocked by another app","tree":{"sha":"fa11a98deaedc75ec21e76e2c0f8c14a3c52aab7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/git/trees/fa11a98deaedc75ec21e76e2c0f8c14a3c52aab7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/git/commits/11daf960fee03c55daf29279a297292171d33cf3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47502916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dandwal","id":47502916,"login":"dandwal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTAyOTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fed-prism/fed-prism/commit/11daf960fee03c55daf29279a297292171d33cf3","node_id":"C_kwDORWM53doAKDExZGFmOTYwZmVlMDNjNTVkYWYyOTI3OWEyOTcyOTIxNzFkMzNjZjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/fed-prism/fed-prism/commit/ce2f734bf1ef04ab7bab409ace759fbda0fcc5f8","sha":"ce2f734bf1ef04ab7bab409ace759fbda0fcc5f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/commits/ce2f734bf1ef04ab7bab409ace759fbda0fcc5f8"}],"sha":"11daf960fee03c55daf29279a297292171d33cf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/commits/11daf960fee03c55daf29279a297292171d33cf3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47502916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dandwal","id":47502916,"login":"dandwal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTAyOTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/commits/ce2f734bf1ef04ab7bab409ace759fbda0fcc5f8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-22T19:29:21Z","email":"danieldwalford@gmail.com","name":"dandwal"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-22T19:29:21Z","email":"danieldwalford@gmail.com","name":"dandwal"},"message":"chore: add pnpm dev:all  single command for full dev stack\n\nAdds concurrently as a root devDependency and a dev:all script\nthat starts all 6 processes in one terminal with labeled, coloured output:\n\n  [server]  node packages/cli/dist/index.js start --no-open  (port 7357)\n  [ui]      pnpm --filter @fed-prism/ui dev                  (port 7358, hot reload)\n  [app-c]   pnpm --filter @fed-prism-examples/app-c dev      (port 3003, Rspack)\n  [app-b]   pnpm --filter @fed-prism-examples/app-b dev      (port 3002, Webpack 5)\n  [app-a]   pnpm --filter @fed-prism-examples/app-a dev      (port 3001, Rsbuild)\n  [shell]   pnpm --filter @fed-prism-examples/shell dev      (port 3000, Rsbuild)\n\nCtrl+C kills all processes. UI changes hot-reload instantly.\nServer changes require pnpm build + restart.","tree":{"sha":"1ff831ab3be36c5a6f17618ea8b63a0869931997","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/git/trees/1ff831ab3be36c5a6f17618ea8b63a0869931997"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/git/commits/ce2f734bf1ef04ab7bab409ace759fbda0fcc5f8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47502916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dandwal","id":47502916,"login":"dandwal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTAyOTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/fed-prism/fed-prism/commit/ce2f734bf1ef04ab7bab409ace759fbda0fcc5f8","node_id":"C_kwDORWM53doAKGNlMmY3MzRiZjFlZjA0YWI3YmFiNDA5YWNlNzU5ZmJkYTBmY2M1Zjg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gi