L-based mf-manifest.json fetcher + polling\n- correlate.ts: CorrelatedView builder (conflict detection, edge typing, DFS cycle detection)\n- index.ts: full Fastify server (WS ingest, SSE /api/events, 5 REST routes,\n  scheduled re-correlation, manifest polling on startup)\n\n@fed-prism/ui:\n- hooks/useSSE.ts: EventSource hook with exponential backoff reconnect\n- App.tsx: wired to live SSE data, header shows connection status + app count\n- pages/Dashboard.tsx: live stat cards, apps table with status badges\n- pages/SharedScope.tsx: declared vs actual dep table, conflict detection/filter\n- pages/DependencyGraph.tsx: React Flow graph, topological layout, edge legend\n- styles/components.css: tables, badges, toolbar, alerts, graph legend\n\npnpm build: 6 packages, 6 successful","tree":{"sha":"e952f7b0bf4a1de2dae7ea42e628b08613a07f55","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/git/trees/e952f7b0bf4a1de2dae7ea42e628b08613a07f55"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/fed-prism/fed-prism/git/commits/e4636003adb8ba48dd874948cff833a22a2159f4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47502916?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/dandwal","id":47502916,"login":"dandwal","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NTAyOTE2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandwal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dandw