url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/commits/2f28c0b807fc2c405771374c896d575e8c3bba12/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T01:28:23Z","email":"brookyale0512@users.noreply.github.com","name":"brookyale0512"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T01:28:23Z","email":"brookyale0512@users.noreply.github.com","name":"brookyale0512"},"message":"docs: update README for two-component architecture\n\n- Rewrite Overview to describe EMR-agnostic engine + OpenMRS module split\n- Add new System Architecture diagram showing Component 1 (Docker engine)\n  and Component 2 (OpenMRS frontend) with any-EMR integration\n- Rewrite Quick Start with three options: engine-only, full stack, npm module\n- Add Air-Gap deployment section with volume-based artifact loading\n- Split API Reference into engine (EMR-agnostic) and OpenMRS-dependent endpoints\n- Split Configuration into engine and full-stack-only sections\n- Fix defaults (KB_SEARCH_MODE=rrf, KB_SNIPPET_CHARS=15000, MODEL_THREADS=8)\n- Add MV2 knowledge base to HuggingFace artifacts table\n- Update Repository Layout with docker/, service/knowledge-base/ paths\n- Fix middleware Dockerfile: default OPENMRS_URL to empty so _require_openmrs()\n  guard works correctly in engine-only mode\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"78d1e4e40dc7509b334da356f345df839dbc2d07","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/git/trees/78d1e4e40dc7509b334da356f345df839dbc2d07"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/git/commits/2f28c0b807fc2c405771374c896d575e8c3bba12","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263218227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/even