ions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/commits/ba1d2856401ac3ad6bc7906236fd676145d0c126/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-03-16T01:20:40Z","email":"brookyale0512@users.noreply.github.com","name":"brookyale0512"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-03-16T01:20:40Z","email":"brookyale0512@users.noreply.github.com","name":"brookyale0512"},"message":"arch: split into two-component architecture (engine + OpenMRS module)\n\nComponent 1 — CDS Engine (docker-compose.yml):\n- Standalone: model + KB + middleware, no OpenMRS dependency\n- Named Docker volumes for all data (no hardcoded host paths)\n- Auto-downloads all artifacts (~6.6 GB) from HuggingFace on first start\n- GPU and CPU profiles via --profile gpu / --profile cpu\n- Exposes engine API on configurable ENGINE_PORT (default 8321)\n- Image names updated to ghcr.io/brookyale0512/clinicdx-*\n\nComponent 2 — OpenMRS full stack (docker-compose.full.yml):\n- Extends engine with nginx reverse proxy (SSL, /clinicdx-api/ proxy)\n- Adds OPENMRS_URL, OPENMRS_USER, OPENMRS_PASSWORD to middleware\n\nMiddleware changes:\n- scribe /manifest and /confirm return 501 when OPENMRS_URL not set\n- /cds/* and /scribe/process* work without OpenMRS (EMR-agnostic)\n\nKB changes:\n- New entrypoint.sh: auto-downloads MV2 index + EmbedGemma 300M\n- Fixed Dockerfile COPY path (services/knowledge-base/ not services/kb/)\n- Added sentence-transformers and torch to requirements.txt\n\nInfrastructure:\n- .env.example cleaned up for t