nosis, first_line, referral, prevention\n\nMiddleware cds_router.py:\n- Increase MAX_KB_QUERIES from 3 to 5\n- Add safety-net forced assessment for both streaming and non-streaming endpoints:\n  when the model exhausts all turns without producing ## Clinical Assessment\n  (e.g. poor KB coverage), force one final generation using clinical knowledge\n- Track all_generated_text across turns for reliable assessment detection\n\nEmbedder:\n- Use EMBED_MODEL_PATH env var instead of hardcoded path\n- Add embedder.py to services/knowledge-base/kb/ (was missing)\n\nMV2 index:\n- Remove old v1 who_knowledge_vec.mv2 (132 MB) from Git LFS\n- MV2 indexes now distributed via HuggingFace (ClinicDx1/ClinicDx)\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"439ea81c666091144a6d65b38665886bc34e64f7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/git/trees/439ea81c666091144a6d65b38665886bc34e64f7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/git/commits/dbd55c0b076130a5c6c030de1f47671535b1c040","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263218227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brookyale0512","id":263218227,"login":"brookyale0512","node_id":"U_kgDOD7BkMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brooky