 output\n- Add validate.py: vLLM-based live KB validation script\n- Add prep_cycle1.py: quality-filter enriched shards, write train/val JSONL\n- Archive old train_cds_lora.py and prep_cds_training.py (renamed _v1_archived)\n\nREADME:\n- KB diagram: port 4276 → 4278+, index name → who_knowledge_vec_v2.mv2\n- KB section: corrects index filename, removes stale wikimed reference\n- Quick Start: daemon command kb.daemon → kb.daemon_v2\n- Layout: cds-lora/ reflects v2 files; kb layout adds v2 files; kb-tool-use-lora marked [ARCHIVED]\n- Port references: 4276 → 4278 throughout (env vars table, API reference, middleware Quick Start)\n- Training table: train_cds_lora.py → train.py; kb-tool-use-lora marked [ARCHIVED]\n\nMade-with: Cursor","tree":{"sha":"eac49d0f76a697234374bc8ea49e82eeb31862ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/git/trees/eac49d0f76a697234374bc8ea49e82eeb31862ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/brookyale0512/ClinicDx-/git/commits/05e052fe56f098ec7e9ab27d7c4d48dfbfebacd6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/263218227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/brookyale0512","id":263218227,"login":"brookyale0512","node_id":"U_kgDOD7BkMw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brookyale0512/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co