:"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45405824?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/DavidKoleczek","id":45405824,"login":"DavidKoleczek","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1NDA1ODI0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/DavidKoleczek","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/402ee0d1e75f2d13e8b090d2b10c716cd60f526d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T21:50:04Z","email":"45405824+DavidKoleczek@users.noreply.github.com","name":"David Koleczek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T21:50:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add create-demo-video skill (#82)\n\n* Add create-demo-video skill\n\nAdds a curated skill for building or revising narrated demo videos with\nthe vid, aud, unfold, and Stories smart tools. It points users to the\nSmart Tools catalog for installation and walks through story, narration,\ndemo cuts, animation, assembly, and end-to-end review.\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Focus create-demo-video on storyboards and real recordings\n\nClarifies that the skill produces demos of something the user built,\nshown from recordings the user supplies or that are made to their\ndirection. Adds a storyboard file as the source of truth for every\nscene, a recommended harness and model, a recordings step, and MP4\ndelivery the user can watch directly.\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Build the create-demo-video storyboard with Stories\n\nCreates and revises the storyboard through the Stories smart tool, with\none panel per scene, and names the smart tool that owns each workflow\nstep so agents call the tools rather than reimplementing their work.\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove create-demo-video storyboard fallback\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Remove music guidance from create-demo-video\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Route create-demo-video edits through smart tools\n\nHas the agent read each smart tool''s help before starting, and describes\ncutting, assembly, and review in terms of vid rather than lower-level\nvideo commands.\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Save the vid plan in create-demo-video assembly\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Deliver create-demo-video through a local review player\n\nHas the agent build a local HTML review player for the final MP4, with\ncaptions, storyboard scene buttons, and download links, and verify it\nbefore handing off the video.\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Add review gates and human checks to create-demo-video\n\nWaits for approval of the storyboard and a voice sample before\nproduction, separates checks the agent runs with tools from checks that\nneed a person, and adds guidance on speech quota, terminal recordings,\ntrial takes, the intro card fallback, and long-running Unfold calls.\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Address demo-video retro: take hygiene, review, captions, verify caveats\n\n- Description: include explainers built around a live demo\n- Step 2: clear screen and scrollback per take, keep terminal takes short,\n  check receipts for a first interaction on every step, and share takes\n  through Showrun''s review dashboard before cutting\n- Step 5: share animations through Unfold''s dashboard and apply notes with\n  Unfold''s refinement before assembly\n- Step 6: start narration after a dissolve ends, or hard-cut, because\n  dissolves crossfade audio\n- Step 7: treat dark-palette black-frame flags as unconfirmed until frames\n  are checked; describe the one expected second render for a loudness fix;\n  build captions from the storyboard narration and scene timeline\n\nGenerated with Amplifier\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Marc Goodner <mgoodner@microsoft.com>","tree":{"sha":"801757fbe4fa72614b47dabd71916037b71f841c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/801757fbe4fa72614b47dabd71916037b71f841c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/402ee0d1e75f2d13e8b090d2b10c716cd60f526d","verification":{"payload":"tree 801757fbe4fa72614b47dabd71916037b71f841c\nparent 85bc17abec044e7feb8589beddec3e425317c52f\nauthor David Koleczek <45405824+DavidKoleczek@users.noreply.github.com> 1790200204 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790200204 -0700\n\nAdd create-demo-video skill (#82)\n\