ipped over-cap skill descriptions in this repo (10 over 400, 7 over 800) correctly left OUT of scope -- stated explicitly as deferred to refresh-descriptions.yaml, not silently swept in. No CI in this repo (stated explicitly). Tests 20 passed both before and after.","tree":{"sha":"e91efb76ec02c0d9aeffc9dc73037d65d0803b2b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/e91efb76ec02c0d9aeffc9dc73037d65d0803b2b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/f7c46ac6d041d263a35f2eb15414f0ba35c6d384","verification":{"payload":"tree e91efb76ec02c0d9aeffc9dc73037d65d0803b2b\nparent 03bded4552205a7d58c1f738230d2f83a58bfe4b\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1788824968 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788824968 -0700\n\nfix(skills): stop the creation skills instructing an over-cap description (#70)\n\nApplies pwmy''s stranded skills-bundle description-alignment patch: personafy/skillify/councilify/skills-assist no longer instruct a description cap above the enforced 400-char skill cap. Clean-room arms measured (validate-bundle-repo.yaml Phase 2.82): patched personafy 3/3 descriptions now under cap (mean 282 vs shipped 456, 2/3 over-cap before); patched skillify already-compliant, unchanged distribution. Honest negative disclosed: the skillify fail-before does not reproduce at n=6 (shipped template already emits 0 over-cap at this sample size vs pwmy''s single-rep 453). The 38 already-shipped over-cap skill descriptions in this repo (10 over 400, 7 over 800) correctly left OUT of scope -- stated explicitly as deferred to refresh-descriptions.yaml, not silently swept in. No CI in this repo (stated explicitly). Tests 20 passed both before and after.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn02ICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAPoIQAE50U7OIsu/EDgtH1EPM1y+g\nfkK0DIqUBeYrIipDVLl9K0TuiKucllKrYRRq1awdLC3BaYJxmt/8O3Bi+Gzqw7FJ\n8+yej7Qy7EuzbULyAbyABwzWEdDGN0bNg7xoc7wlAFA