by name (load_skill). HEADLINE FINDING (3rd independent confirmation this program, deduped into model_performance-c21w): hiding a skill GROWS the always-on catalog (+19.4% measured on this repo''s own 3-arm census) because the user-invoked section is unbudgeted -- disable-model-invocation is an auto-invocation control, not a byte-saving lever. CI 7/7.","tree":{"sha":"be20ba89c2bfb1b1e1c04b4418b939e740c08406","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/be20ba89c2bfb1b1e1c04b4418b939e740c08406"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/03bded4552205a7d58c1f738230d2f83a58bfe4b","verification":{"payload":"tree be20ba89c2bfb1b1e1c04b4418b939e740c08406\nparent dbd5201bd90aa2e88dd0814b40948388ef0c29a4\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1788822789 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788822789 -0700\n\nperf(skills): fold 13 *-patterns into one umbrella, hide 12 hand-run skills (#69)\n\nSkills catalog reduction: 12 persona lenses hidden (disable-model-invocation) except tester-breaker/restless-old-brian (385/236 standalone uses, verified unchanged); adapt-skill/councilify/personafy/skillify hidden. Real-session verification: /council and /product-council still fan out to lenses by name; every hidden skill still loads by name (load_skill). HEADLINE FINDING (3rd independent confirmation this program, deduped into model_performance-c21w): hiding a skill GROWS the always-on catalog (+19.4% measured on this repo''s own 3-arm census) because the user-invoked section is unbudgeted -- disable-model-invocation is an auto-invocation control, not a byte-saving lever. CI 7/7.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqn0UFCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAzm4QAGhCQE1w7Hif/bFs8dsBNY3J\nfbZidmbtBdvpwlj5q1KgIteNqcfw3HO/y2PbpGRAQRnTLQciDKYZ3vazTVqlL4lh\nMq6tQ/xXF+0Dq4BZz/Fe/PmwDs8SfGjVFxQgd607vpPHXq8A1gqemTAIT9R65r/G\nrhmmeh0MkrQxLa5YmQl2vlMBBV2NFlg2h6auXT0Ppp/TPD+EVr7qK+2Rl6