,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/c2e204965f652657ec34d5f6918c9004032b1a6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T02:08:51Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T02:08:51Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: remove /goal-dependent skills (moved to amplifier-app-cli) (#60)\n\n* chore: remove /goal-dependent skills from bundle\n\n/goal-dependent skills (goal-batch, goalify, ten-lane-highway) belong with\nthe /goal command in amplifier-app-cli. They are now maintained there as a\ncohesive unit alongside the CLI that invokes them.\n\nmonitor remains in amplifier-bundle-skills because it has no /goal dependency\nand is used more broadly by recipes and other consumers.\n\nGenerated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: remove goal-batch from curated skills table in bundle.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"a3c90ac2a7468f3562f1646907d44368b9e7f10b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/a3c90ac2a7468f3562f1646907d44368b9e7f10b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/c2e204965f652657ec34d5f6918c9004032b1a6a","verification":{"payload":"tree a3c90ac2a7468f3562f1646907d44368b9e7f10b\nparent c4057ac323bd29023f6f533193a221f2a6897b8e\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1787191731 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787191731 -0700\n\nchore: remove /goal-dependent skills (moved to amplifier-app-cli) (#60)\n\n* chore: remove /goal-dependent skills from bundle\n\n/goal-dependent skills (goal-batch, goalify, ten-lane-highway) belong with\nthe /goal command in amplifier-app-cli. They are now maintained there as a\ncohesive unit alongside the CLI that invokes them.\n\nmonitor remains in amplifier-bundle-skills because it has no /goal dependency\nand is used more broadly by recipes and other consumers.\n\nGenerated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* chore: remove goal-batch from curated skills table in bundle.md\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhmGzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAM14QAC/Q0XE8+QV51hPtqlZ3uSrW\njpJ3NrNwd0Eko9jsjkma2ssQwRJGUyPOTIjJtHK4F92ONQwRlF6LLNx593vTHKBI\n7ChAvtKRNfNxnFmn3FAZFgMGt53lq6jWx8atgg66w7UsPyQ8DU5Kzg7nc8Dn8JJW\nfE+tnK9rUS8+iDZF7Q9x+7jkvXs9Nmry4odCneGw6sOFoH4wEzqiYZRqLJkBHj46\n+W04Kb1IT6FKvbxGGRW3tfXzqQp1UDAlMUt01fTOyfHYuO0C0HXgssZeX/ulmnzb\npfKZ3nYPqC5zr4GglK9CiZ8dUa/Dot8PynJ7FJWQqn5RI3ThiCoGANbEmdNKeXty\nXXxyCURSl0VFzbAqxdaskBMOuT7l4i/dEedQgynGrsJqXt3lCLK7VseuK98t4oDa\nxhwkmvblfG9HHEw23R50URwJV/rxGthkDbA72js3kLdyV2W0pHUQY8BuL/ow2Oj/\n/KdC6FFocVQewJI08wB/zoQa0LVpqEvOcvSUdLVD1gTaXLrMF0g/4We36f49/b1s\nxyKEPXDp+3HHFBv18UvoqmIf5Xqqr0SFqoRoDp0NLs7bk10j/ITx7fOTZO4a0fct\nUuwkt2lh0UZRKE0m/cbfTz5k6hFyqgr8GjpHSW2P+wLfbHwqIt5Of+VPCtMS1H2e\nQBnyYjadhJTzA2qgkis6\n=fRzL\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-20T02:08:52Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commit/c2e204965f652657ec34d5f6918c9004032b1a6a","node_id":"C_kwDORWWbQtoAKGMyZTIwNDk2NWY2NTI2NTdlYzM0ZDVmNjkxOGM5MDA0MDMyYjFhNmE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commit/c4057ac323bd29023f6f533193a221f2a6897b8e","sha":"c4057ac323bd29023f6f533193a221f2a6897b8e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/c4057ac323bd29023f6f533193a221f2a6897b8e"}],"sha":"c2e204965f652657ec34d5f6918c9004032b1a6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/c2e204965f652657ec34d5f6918c9004032b1a6a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/c4057ac323bd29023f6f533193a221f2a6897b8e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-18T20:24:57Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-18T20:24:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: load Windows-authored SKILL.md files + safe shell-exec on Windows (#59)\n\nThree Windows-specific fixes:\n\n- Strip UTF-8 BOM before parsing SKILL.md frontmatter, so Windows-authored\n  skill files load instead of silently failing frontmatter detection.\n- Guard the timeout kill path against POSIX-only os.killpg on Windows;\n  kill the child process directly and tolerate AttributeError.\n- Forward cmd.exe essentials (SystemRoot, ComSpec, PATHEXT) through the\n  safe-env allowlist using case-insensitive matching, since CPython\n  upper-cases os.environ keys on Windows.\n\nTests exercise the real timeout branch behaviorally rather than grepping\nmodule source, and assert on environment keys case-insensitively so they\nhold on the actual Windows platform.","tree":{"sha":"87fa3e97a499b301278fabbe5b5992eba509991d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/87fa3e97a499b301278fabbe5b5992eba509991d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/c4057ac323bd29023f6f533193a221f2a6897b8e","verification":{"payload":"tree 87fa3e97a499b301278fabbe5b5992eba509991d\nparent 44bd261b3af7bf15f1e48ced2c642dd69325f710\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1787084697 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787084697 -0700\n\nfix: load Windows-authored SKILL.md files + safe shell-exec on Windows (#59)\n\nThree Windows-specific fixes:\n\n- Strip UTF-8 BOM before parsing SKILL.md frontmatter, so Windows-authored\n  skill files load instead of silently failing frontmatter detection.\n- Guard the timeout kill path against POSIX-only os.killpg on Windows;\n  kill the child process directly and tolerate AttributeError.\n- Forward cmd.exe essentials (SystemRoot, ComSpec, PATHEXT) through the\n  safe-env allowlist using case-insensitive matching, since CPython\n  upper-cases os.environ keys on Windows.\n\nTests exercise the real timeout branch behaviorally rather than grepping\nmodule source, and assert on environment keys case-insensitively so they\nhold on the actual Windows platform.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhL+ZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAATFsQACqk7hWmcwyjt435ZnP5MOth\n0vP29fKOLNYr0tjuSzWCv/esX1N7ae/Esa3ZoTboD7WZfagRhxL+i/Ow7x/JlNK7\npImaga4KlvyfZewFjdRhwAgiRL3grKhPURzGw1SIQtLmZFztr0d+TGs+Js1rws2+\nWC6A+GWm4rTScYHQ1u4fFcxShkUPuuig9uJZBOucZO2Otumi7TUU/SBoz0vbnkjF\nt6+v3l+ELimBKyK75i5PMV37QS5FINrZN+oH8xc/+k+Coxfm31CRuz0ZBFlRIf4/\nsiCYZIgDv9/mT6nKNkHAv9wNABBaEmif3GoMXMn5hruw9NX6g6STBtm5p4iPZCG5\nNjAbTPMtIKRxlmRCMosOocXgkglyM5bbtQ6HRWneZCk4pR4mQmaPR/fE1VJ0RCcL\nhZhcfoGCxbwmnQmG9VFyHiZAwu1DCgiWUGlgmyIfhWDNsGHH3/GIEA+pN9fVhE/k\nImFbQJd50Dx4FUQ4GZO/sqRXImdLajpPRHGmNSNEOPPXEoe2hEskVUh5eseG3XLY\naZiNS/Ly6L669t9xQQ2b74uORLQ3KjW3EsDrEHT+mhMIlwcZX74vxwmc/ydOSDDf\nqMnBW+MFOyUca6LK044kUm0QsMkHB/iV2uu1K5zSw4FSpympYCx95sO9PqYAEj8V\njr0OWXc/aJ80LbftI8rq\n=0wU3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-18T20:24:57Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-f