://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/f5ea2a05ccb265e24d4afc07c045df41aff117b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-31T14:08:00Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-31T14:08:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add Product Development Council skills (6 product-delivery lenses) (#50)\n\nAdds the Product Development Council — a council of six orthogonal product-delivery review lenses, following the same pattern as the existing council/council-here skills already in this repo.\n\nNew skills:\n- product-council: orchestrator for cold independent fan-out, debate-to-consensus, synthesized verdict with recorded dissent + roster manifest\n- product-council-here: inline counterpart that reviews the current conversation/work-in-progress\n- outcomist: outcome-clarity lens (mandatory problem-validation gate)\n- outcome-cartographer: outcome-validity lens (mapped to measurable metric, not just feature list)\n- positioning-critic: competitive-differentiation lens (why this over alternatives)\n- bet-sizer: delivery-risk lens (investment sized to team confidence)\n\nThe council reuses two existing lenses already in this repo:\n- user-advocate\n- intent-keeper\n\nNo bundle.md changes needed — pattern skills and existing council/persona skills are not listed in the Curated Skills table.\n\nGenerated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier)\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"c664549c5177edf7bdb3b5fd1cfe8412e0275320","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/c664549c5177edf7bdb3b5fd1cfe8412e0275320"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/f5ea2a05ccb265e24d4afc07c045df41aff117b6","verification":{"payload":"tree c664549c5177edf7bdb3b5fd1cfe8412e0275320\nparent 7746682d9b3264d1d3b7d5660093535ea06eddd7\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1785506880 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785506880 -0700\n\nfeat: add Product Development Council skills (6 product-delivery lenses) (#50)\n\nAdds the Product Development Council — a council of six orthogonal product-delivery review lenses, following the same pattern as the existing council/council-here skills already in this repo.\n\nNew skills:\n- product-council: orchestrator for cold independent fan-out, debate-to-consensus, synthesized verdict with recorded dissent + roster manifest\n- product-council-here: inline counterpart that reviews the current conversation/work-in-progress\n- outcomist: outcome-clarity lens (mandatory problem-validation gate)\n- outcome-cartographer: outcome-validity lens (mapped to measurable metric, not just feature list)\n- positioning-critic: competitive-differentiation lens (why this over alternatives)\n- bet-sizer: delivery-risk lens (investment sized to team confidence)\n\nThe council reuses two existing lenses already in this repo:\n- user-advocate\n- intent-keeper\n\nNo bundle.md changes needed — pattern skills and existing council/persona skills are not listed in the Curated Skills table.\n\nGenerated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microso