rabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/49c3c26471376617c4c88083be4c91df22904801/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-05T13:31:01Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-05T13:31:01Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"docs(leverage-patterns): fix stale repo-weaver exemplar + add cross-repo sharing section (#39)\n\nrepo-weaver no longer has `dependencies = []`: it now imports wiki-weaver''s corpus-layout constants as a real git dependency (single source of truth, guarded by a contract test) while keeping the LLM synthesis engine behind the subprocess boundary. Corrects the now-inaccurate exemplar and adds a ''Sharing across repos without vendoring'' section documenting the mechanism (git-URL dep + [tool.hatch.metadata] allow-direct-references + contract test + upstream-first merge order).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier)\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"147483dad28cbc4629a66e464cc4eb4a2b165e04","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/147483dad28cbc4