riptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/1a7b9d08e77b36c1e09460802d773a55ef572359/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-08T22:43:38Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-08T22:43:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add personafy skill for creating advisor-persona archetypes (#25)\n\nAdd the new ''personafy'' skill (canonical /command, with ''personify'' shortcut alias\nfor the common typo). personafy is a meta-authoring skill that captures the\nrepeatable process for creating opinionated advisor-persona skills — a reviewer\n''lens'' like crusty-old-engineer.\n\nThe skill encodes: study the family → define the load-bearing lens → mine voice\nand discipline from real evidence (deterministic extraction, fan-out agents,\ntwo-tier synthesis) → draft to the family template → PROVE it steers live →\nreduce → name/home (public vs private) → publish via canonical directory-discovery →\nprove it loads from the bundle.\n\nThe skill has been verified locally: the real discover_skills() loader parsed it\ncleanly (name=personafy, shortcut=personify, user_invocable=true, no warnings).\n\nGenerated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier)\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"ec02587927b737d933fbf1935dc4493a0d0b2af7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/ec02587927b737d933fbf1935dc4493a0d0b2af7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/1a7b9d08e77b36c1e09460802d773a55ef572359","verification":{"payload":"tree ec02587927b737d933fbf1935dc4493a0d0b2af7\nparent 2e1c461c9527b6efd1ac34fae4942f59ba1ceb49\nauthor Brian Krabach