","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/189b47b84aa63da6e132d58f8f1be66e37ac8d93/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T17:07:12Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T17:07:12Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"chore: remove per-repo-conventions skill (relocated to amplifier-foundation) (#23)\n\nThe per-repo-conventions skill is being relocated into the amplifier-foundation\nbundle, co-located with its canonical doc at foundation:docs/PER_REPO_CONVENTIONS.md.\n\nThe skill had duplicated that doc''s content and drifted stale (missing KNOWN_ISSUES.md,\nthe read/re-read cadence, and the debugging trigger). Maintaining a separate content\ncopy in a separate repo violated DRY and made updates require cross-repo coordination.\n\nInstead of dual maintenance, the skill becomes a slim auto-surfaced pointer living\nnext to the doc it references — making updates atomic and eliminating cross-repo drift.\n\nThe replacement (a thin pointer skill that references the doc without duplicating it)\nis added in the companion amplifier-foundation PR. To avoid a window where the stale\nduplicate is loaded, this removal should land at or before the foundation PR''s merge.","tree":{"sha":"ca3b052e47ecd445f6727f806163b2c421880bf5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/ca3b052e47ecd445f6727f806163b2c421880bf5"},"url":