2d98728c221543dfcf4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/cf2eff9743e94952aa8a3ab5a804ec3f70dcf144/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:48:39Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-29T15:48:39Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"message":"fix(skills): restore SkillsDiscovery.get_shortcuts() deleted by malformed edit\n\nRoot cause: an edit_file call in a prior session used the wrong parameter\nname (new_str instead of new_string), which silently deleted the original\nmethod body without inserting the replacement. The defective file was merged\nas PR #20 (commit 183e0c0). The class was left with only __init__,\nlist_skills, and find — no get_shortcuts.\n\nImpact: every user-invocable skill (user-invocable: true) was silently\ndropped from slash-command dispatch. /cranky-old-sam, /cosam, and all\nother non-power-skill slash commands returned ''Unknown command''.\nPower skills (disable-model-invocation: true) were unaffected.\n\nFix: reinsert get_shortcuts() at __init__.py:329-351, between find() and\nSkillsTool. The method iterates self._skills, skips non-user-invocable\nskills, builds a dispatch entry {name, description, context} for each\nuser-invocable skill, registers it under the canonical name, and also\nregisters it under metadata.shortcut when shortcut differs from name.\nReturn type: dict[str, dict[str, Any]]. Any was already imported.\n\nTests: extend test_skills_discovery.py with 5 new regression-guard tests:\n- test_method_exists_on_class: class-level guard — would have caught this\n- test_empty_skills_dict_returns_empty_dict: empty dict fast-path\n- test_entry_has_name_key: entry shape includes required ''name'' key\n- test_shortcut_registers_alias_key: /cosam → cranky-old-sam dispatch\n- test_shortcut_equal_to_canonical_name_is_idempotent: no duplicate entry\n\nAlso update _make_skill helper to accept shortcut parameter.\n\nTDD: confirmed all 9 new+existing get_shortcuts tests failed before fix,\nall 19 tests in test_skills_discovery.py pass after fix.\nFull suite: 236 passed, 2 pre-existing failures (amplifier_foundation not\ninstalled in test venv — unrelated to this change).\n\nFixes: SkillsDiscovery.get_shortcuts() regression introduced in #20.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Amplifier](https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1deb3dbbe2606b283646327ffa721ff16f385bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/1deb3dbbe2606b283646327ffa721ff16f385bd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/cf2eff9743e94952aa8a3ab5a804ec3f70dcf144","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/event