plifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"b4e2e458e709fa503ceea541021f9a46f6e94be5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/b4e2e458e709fa503ceea541021f9a46f6e94be5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/a55f29e3e93cc29e282ab93ad4ed7c398a47b192","verification":{"payload":"tree b4e2e458e709fa503ceea541021f9a46f6e94be5\nparent d95880b4c3b47629ed2d8373ca0b2e95e33aa020\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1779568980 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1779568980 -0700\n\ndocs: add Phase-specific files (JIT) section to per-repo-conventions skill (#18)\n\nThis section teaches agents to load PRINCIPLES.md at the design phase and\nSMOKE_TESTS.md at the verification phase, only when referenced in AGENTS.md\nand the phase fires. These are JIT-loaded files to avoid unnecessary context\nat task start.\n\nThis is part of a coordinated 5-repo docs rollout introducing phase-specific\nwell-known files alongside the existing AGENTS.md and PR template conventions.\nCompanion PRs landing in parallel in: amplifier-foundation, amplifier-bundle-attractor,\namplifier-resolver-dot-graph, and amplifier-bundle-resolve. Docs-only change\nacross all repos.\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <240397093+microsoft-amplifier@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqEhFUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAt3QQAGkG/7zA3xA094JNsshFiJ7Z\npZGQI+atYhvzcnJYLoAHKoO9SL8fFiCkG6+fFqH7uqIOMwoH6LHCpEIaok/lhPn+\nNz5Jz3wfeBoPV399R/xGc8dn/WHxlfi7BnJaRs18ZK2uyo2yLnWR7eHnb9WvaAnt\nCIBlCtTSFBddCXhcJAZYuk/X+EvMXYi0RAYMUbk1AWDeHjeNCULHMDSINyBcLMlY\nUwHymwl9O4Y4iXZLtZEC08LLy0KoB6E2yWiKb4665FsiUrokUvlcp3j+A1avLCeJ\n/utsnAFYMHqAml7848fJk47rBXWobavcDBmOXiyr0EwAk3OMR4RtVcqiSfdfAEDM\n/ubfe3kH7cBHZmBFeNUZ/4zNmwQMTVh/iR31thzu0MCoGHuv1//jIUxdT2DkQwx8\nRm2j6d5pQw5vwJG3XJRB2uVo6ybfV2LTzFuLHedwiog9+QCGfwrI1uPYtgGFoemR\nhUsv//sUPC0oFOD/EoY6iumKvBr/jepx