h/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/f4c2b2dc47e6c04ab3ff2750e78c0546c17fb3c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T21:13:08Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T21:13:08Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"message":"fix(tool-skills): include runtime_skill_overlay in search and list operations (#233)\n\nRead runtime_skill_overlay coordinator capability in _get_overlay_skill_metadata().\nThe capability holds URIs resolved by mention_resolver to skill directories.\nPer-URI failures are logged at DEBUG and never block other URIs.\nLocal skills shadow overlay skills (first-match-wins).\n\n_list_skills() and _search_skills() now build effective_skills by merging\nself.skills + _get_overlay_skill_metadata() before any filtering or output.\n\nReads coordinator.config directly via get_capability(), not from any caller\nparameter. Works for all session types (root, sub-session, test harness).\n\nFoundation import uses try/except fallback to the known string constant so\nthe module loads cleanly in deployments without amplifier-foundation installed.\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <amplifier@microsoft.com>","tree":{"sha":"e8a82e31e12223f9a8384ba69a6cfc27cf045be0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/e8a82e31e12223f9a8384ba69a6cfc27cf045be0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/f4c2b2dc47e6c04ab3ff2750e78c0546c17fb3c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commit/f4c2b2dc47e6c04ab3ff2750e78c0546c17fb3c6","node_id":"C_kwDORWWbQtoAKGY0YzJiMmRjNDdlNmMwNGFiM2ZmMjc1MGU3OGMwNTQ2YzE3ZmIzYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commit/9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906","sha":"9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906"}],"sha":"f4c2b2dc47e6c04ab3ff2750e78c0546c17fb3c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/f4c2b2dc47e6c04ab3ff2750e78c0546c17fb3c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T21:09:26Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T21:09:26Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"message":"test(tool-skills): cover runtime_skill_overlay capability resolution\n\nFour tests for Issue #233 overlay-skills consumer:\n- test_overlay_skill_appears_in_list_skills: RED (implementation missing)\n- test_overlay_skill_found_by_search_skills: RED (implementation missing)\n- test_local_skills_shadow_overlay_on_conflict: GREEN (local-wins invariant)\n- test_no_overlay_capability_baseline: GREEN (regression guard for no-mode case)\n\nCo-authored-by: Amplifier <amplifier@microsoft.com>","tree":{"sha":"27c061dd18c24729cff25806f5178893e786c242","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/27c061dd18c24729cff25806f5178893e786c242"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commit/9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906","node_id":"C_kwDORWWbQtoAKDllODBhODhiNDYxYzVmZTFiMzJmOGZlMzEwMDkzNDM3YWI2NzM5MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commit/290521188261d4b39d4125652cbceb5a5165e3ad","sha":"290521188261d4b39d4125652cbceb5a5165e3ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/290521188261d4b39d4125652cbceb5a5165e3ad"}],"sha":"9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/9e80a88b461c5fe1b32f8fe310093437ab673906"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bkrabach","id":702425,"login":"bkrabach","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcwMjQyNQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/290521188261d4b39d4125652cbceb5a5165e3ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-13T13:12:21Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-13T13:12:21Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: fork skills with model_role now consult model_role_resolver capability (#14)\n\nPre-existing bug: SkillsTool._execute_fork() looked up a capability\nnamed \"routing_matrix\" that was never registered (the routing-matrix\nbundle wrote to session_state[\"routing_matrix\"] instead) and called\n.resolve() synchronously on the result. Both were wrong.\n\nNet effect: fork skills declaring `model_role` silently fell back\nto the parent''s default provider, regardless of which routing matrix\nwas active. With provider-anthropic at priority: 1 in user settings,\nthat meant every fork skill ran on anthropic — even when the openai\nmatrix was active. Reproduced via DTU runs against both matrices.\n\nFix: switch to the renamed model_role_resolver capability and await\nthe async resolve() call. Forwards the resulting\nlist[ProviderPreference] to spawn_fn, so the child sub-session\nrespects the active routing strategy.\n\nIncludes a regression test (TDD-style — verified to fail pre-fix,\npass post-fix) covering:\n  - Resolver consulted with the declared role\n  - Returned ProviderPreferences forwarded to spawn_fn\n  - Graceful fall-through when no resolver capability is registered\n\nCross-repo PR set (must merge close in time):\n- microsoft/amplifier-bundle-routing-matrix#???    (producer)\n- microsoft/amplifier-foundation#???                (tool-delegate, hooks-session-naming)\n- microsoft/amplifier-bundle-recipes#???            (tool-recipes)\n- microsoft/amplifier-module-tool-skills#???        (deprecated mirror — same fix)\n- microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills#???             (this commit, canonical)\n\nCo-authored-by: amplifier-bug-hunter <bug-hunter@amplifier.local>","tree":{"sha":"c8d2d9275bb5dcbae4779f93ae673c343635b29b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/c8d2d9275bb5dcbae4779f93ae673c343635b29b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/290521188261d4b39d4125652cbceb5a5165e3ad","verification":{"payload":"tree c8d2d9275bb5dcbae4779f93ae673c343635b29b\nparent 87960e8c1045e19e66800a2538862455687cb8c4\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1778677941 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1778677941 -0700\n\nfix: fork skills with model_role now consult model_role_resolver capability (#14)\n\nPre-existing bug: SkillsTool._execute_fork() looked up a capability\nnamed \"routing_matrix\" that was never registered (the routing-matrix\nbundle wrote to session_state[\"routing_matrix\"] instead) and called\n.resolve() synchronously on the result. Both were wrong.\n\nNet effect: fork skills declaring `model_role` silently fell back\nto the parent''s default provider, regardless of which routing matrix\nwas active. With provider-anthropic at priority: 1 in user settings,\nthat meant every fork skill ran on anthropic — even when the openai\nmatrix was active. Reproduced via DTU runs against both matrices.\n\nFix: switch to the renamed model_role_resolver capability and await\nthe async resolve() call. Forwards the resulting\nlist[ProviderPreference] to spawn_fn, so the child sub-session\nrespects the active routing strategy.\n\nIncludes a regression test (TDD-style — verified to fail pre-fix,\npass post-fix) covering:\n  - Resolver consulted with the declared role\n  - Returned ProviderPreferences forwarded to spawn_fn\n  - Graceful fall-through when no resolver capability is registered\n\nCross-repo PR set (must merge close in time):\n- microsoft/amplifier-bundle-routing-matrix#???    (producer)\n- microsoft/amplifier-foundation#???                (tool-delegate, hooks-session-naming)\n- microsoft/amplifier-bundle-recipes#???            (tool-recipes)\n- microsoft/amplifier-module-tool-skills#???        (deprecated mirror — same fix)\n- microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills#???             (this commit, canonical)\n\nCo-authored-by: amplifier-bug-hunter <bug-hunter@amplifier.local>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqBHi1CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAed4QAKOG0xJn7xXhru85Exr3HZG/\nXD+1QDmGppXtrAGkFsgdrpImS5J/E4ZXnwhWXJXrkdJ6xleYxMXEXudjPMgOSH6M\nylaTHKP88viWpVYG1C72yldHfmMfA8o9HspuiwVi+L0T8K076yGxZLWvJ+IozO4K\nHqxGiTfqdAVw3ogWffX9GJLMZ+fzQW3VDp9xv7tTJsYdnUF74G8tdxMWgxi4+pYS\npL+bRwaHeOnVkR8mU60UevPaFB1UvePsHX87XfVGxCMjiyYixKJt5qhJS4JUoUUR\nFKeYClbEy1NACUhujCzj/WWIjbz6bPU1v2JFkpiXP27s3bH0QQFSMXZtg9IRLqcD\nkSBpwuv41eujhNmTTI5GC8E390JsiP7gj3hdMdggHpRVnUefDMPUU50FTrGWGiv9\nZJlhcPCP8qwfGONPpD+JuIEqRz9LSRmaxZ1LZ8+WI1HtkOZy+dLHAKeg6flNWApv\nA1cJ0Qb3JoisHDh8Jihac+K4lHQ8ehAlrHbCyo7qJKATh8lrASVnr38pXqS8dTWO\n+yH4z407Q5T/SovEkbBQZX7pgjSjh3shCKDqkub19sRv96MtrMhP8WPhmNoW278Z\n9KuwWBcRKLh8GjtLTsBRtD/udWkSQBN7zjSv0raGtdFPquCRI9nEhUMBb3cDRwSI\nHiE/cKXrWfQFgJe2uHUV\n=XsJS\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----