/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/bfe404408993a39a9fd64e079ae3ec2edc7e61d8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-14T22:19:37Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-14T22:19:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add 10 production pattern library skills (#10)\n\n36 reusable patterns extracted from production Python CLI tools, web\nservices, and React frontends. Each skill provides working starter code,\nkey design decisions, and real-incident gotchas.\n\nSkills added:\n- cli-packaging-patterns: uv/npm install, subcommand dispatch, 3-tier config\n- config-state-patterns: defaults merging, atomic writes, XDG paths\n- http-service-patterns: FastAPI lifecycle, SPA proxy, WebSocket relay, SSE\n- auth-tls-patterns: localhost bypass, PAM auth cascade, TLS auto-setup\n- self-managing-tool-patterns: doctor, PEP 610 upgrade, systemd/launchd\n- file-ipc-patterns: JSONL events, atomic state, async request/response\n- instance-storage-patterns: per-instance dirs, file locking, session factories\n- container-orchestration-patterns: Docker safety limits, watchdog, sidecars\n- plugin-discovery-patterns: entry points, file registry, provider abstractions\n- react-microfrontend-patterns: import maps, frecency autocomplete, Zustand","tree":{"sha":"762dcb622a8096ac4f854295e15e023dbdceebaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/762dcb622a8096ac4f854295e15e023dbdceebaa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/bfe404408993a39a9fd64e079ae3ec2edc7e61d8","verification":{"payload":"tree 762dcb622a8096ac4f854295e15e023dbdceebaa\nparent e8d54ad7fdcb07c19f8048f8a1b7235b337747ac\nauthor Brian Krabach <brkrabac@microsoft.com> 1776205177 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1776205177 -0700\n\nfeat: add 10 production pattern library skills (#10)\n\n36 reusable patterns extracted from production Python CLI tools, web\nservices, and React frontends. Each skill provides working starter code,\nkey design decisions, and real-incident gotchas.\n\nSkills added:\n- cli-packaging-patterns: uv/npm install, subcommand dispatch, 3-tier config\n- config-state-patterns: defaults merging, atomic writes, XDG paths\n- http-service-patterns: FastAPI lifecycle, SPA proxy, WebSocket relay, SSE\n- auth-tls-patterns: localhost bypass, PAM auth cascade, TLS auto-setup\n- self-managing-tool-patterns: doctor, PEP 610 upgrade, systemd/launchd\n- file-ipc-patterns: JSONL events, atomic state, async request/response\n- instance-storage-patterns: per-instance dirs, file locking, session factories\n- container-orchestration-patterns: Docker safety limits, watchdog, sidecars\n- plugin-discovery-patterns: entry points, file registry, provider abstractions\n- react-microfrontend-patterns: import maps, frecency autocomplete, Zustand","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJp3r15CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAg3EQADCCskDSXw8IBABSmeLmN0ix\n07SR58oGWpRCDGiplxWZIJp1XbDja11QCsAB61SX2LRwNQNZ+CrG8jgBYXfU5kaL\nhGVF1bJZS9I0hfXkETF/eQ3Ti2uWNHoC8GXTaNfbkUVtIyshRvZtKQCsGXKEdGpB\nLRR0lyGHrLMzCC3QTxYWRwD10d+irQyraT47umXmljmwz4zQLSqFIWdjbWe6cejh\nXKffHkSjgTmCDtoGl1EJUa+8CnrQC8SXB1g+K+Q5mIdxybu/xAFE6FjKMsLfSYku\nZhum/5Y58YYZeCr+mAOwg5GLgqlVgyOcBT8Bn1lTy7ZQ01FHhw0q4wxAgCT0qfT0\nK8Y6c8Ov2p1yBKNlyXVU+FYPp7t083yiYnDIVL4RNGJ58FHpjuD1I7levzaov8Q3\nwN2bdeujM+kqRdcYGkiT9P7kj2GGXvu+TGLdHV3P0ekAxvQDDiYoLlpK2rC4OC3u\nixpby2+pJAKfERLs1Yo/rN7Py6xY6YFgLaGrqLFkcJeeB6O+gcaTLI8iW8h4Kg2b\ni3x7RUdGn1eXsD4+iF9bmadhFMMxh6ZYavtEn4qGRLmJR0mNdKNDPOLmIQo3/ELG\nF6pVHu+B0BQfd5IOWi/4UBPnZTo9aOoVpUL9qoL6bYFDENixq5CDubKx21ruFsE9\nGzcgloIyFxXS2qY5bRtY\n=H+ik\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-14T22:19:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url