users/bkrabach/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/commits/3656c46ab5a568401cd9b1bd954881ea8d26a49b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-08T16:10:56Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-08T16:10:56Z","email":"brkrabac@microsoft.com","name":"Brian Krabach"},"message":"feat: add adapt-skill skill for porting skills from other AI assistants\n\nCreate the adapt-skill SKILL.md that guides adaptation of skills from\nother AI coding assistants (Claude Code, Cursor, etc.) into Amplifier-\nnative SKILL.md files.\n\nKey design decisions:\n- Inline (no context: fork) for multi-round user interaction\n- Model-invocable for natural phrase triggering\n- Skills-assist as source of truth for Amplifier conventions\n- 8-step workflow: consult, explore, analyze, research, design, write, test, ship\n- Testing step uses delegate(agent=\"self\") for verification\n- Includes delegate in allowed-tools for skills-assist and explorer","tree":{"sha":"f32f2eab57ee5611c561b7c5aad348134611171e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/trees/f32f2eab57ee5611c561b7c5aad348134611171e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/amplifier-bundle-skills/git/commits/3656c46ab5a568401cd9b1bd954881ea8d26a49b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/702425?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bkrabach/following{/o